  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0167.jpeg': {arabic:'هل أنت أناني؟ للأستاذ محمد فؤاد - آلام الظهر: ها هو ذا الآلام فأين سلوان؟ سلون أبو شنب صديق المصريين المجرب / أيتها الأمهات الحيارى اهدئن من روعكن.. شركه فتله وصلتها الأغذية الخاصة بالأطفال: نيتوجين، لاكتوجين، لارجون، اليدون',headline:'Are you selfish? by Mohamed Foyad / Back pain relief ad for Salon Abu Shanab the tried friend / Anxious mothers calm down... Fatla Co. received specialized infant foods: Netogen Lactogen Largon Elidon'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0168.jpeg': {arabic:'شهرزاد 1365',headline:'Scheherazade 1365'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0169.jpeg': {arabic:'فتاة الأدغال - تعاقد المنتج الإنكليزي «آدلر رانك» مع النجمة نعيمة عاكف على أن تقفز بتمثيل / أبو الشبل',headline:'"The Girl of the Jungle" — film feature: Egyptian star Naima Akef has signed with British producer Adler Rank to star in an African-adventure film "The Girl of the Jungle," filmed in Arabic language; large color photo of Naima Akef in a red-polka-dot blouse holding a lion cub while an adult lion roars beside her; below, a smaller photo of Naima with a tiger cub — captioned "Naima carrying the newborn cub after the trust between her and Abu Al-Shibl was established"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0170.jpeg': {arabic:'الفنانة بين مصر والسودان علي فسيلة / احتفظوا بكوبونات نابلسي فاروق [إعلان] / الحرير الممتاز وجهازات العرايس الرائعة - الويشى [إعلان] / فورية النجوم - كريم عبده / همبى عبده جوهرى [إعلانات محلات]',headline:'"The Artist Between Egypt and Sudan — Ali Fasseela" — photo feature: (top) a couple flirting at a candlelit dinner; (bottom) a Sudanese woman elegantly reclining on a floor cushion smoking a hookah, with a Sudanese-themed rug; captions describe the actress\'s role in a film shot between Cairo and Sudan / [Ads] Nabulsi Farouk soap coupons; Al-Wushi — premium silks and lavish trousseau outfits (Cairo, Alexandria); Nujoom Furrier — coats and furs; Hambi Abdo Gouhari — Cairo jewelry'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0171.jpeg': {arabic:'مسابقة قصة! / جماعة من الفتيات في نزهة يعانين مسابقة النضج',headline:'"A Story Contest!" — women\'s contest page: a black-and-white photo of a group of young women picnicking on a hillside together, laughing; a portrait of a poised woman holding a bouquet of grain stalks and roses; text invites readers to submit personal stories on love, work and family life — winning entry will be published in the magazine'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0172.jpeg': {arabic:'ساحر الخزائن - بقلم كبير المحررين / راكب الحرام [كاريكاتير]',headline:'"The Wizard of the Vaults" — feature by the chief editor: an exposé/anecdotal piece about a notorious con-man in early-20th-century Cairo who called himself "Wolis" and defrauded wealthy Egyptian and Alexandrian merchants for over a quarter-century until he was arrested by Inspector Ahmad Abd al-Rahman Pasha and confessed his crimes / Bottom cartoon: "The Illicit Rider" — political humor drawing of two well-dressed men'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0173.jpeg': {arabic:'تانجي Tange - قلمياً - ماكياج فمك وشفتيك [إعلان أحمر شفاه] / جامعة فاروق الأول - إدارة المستخدمين - إعلان / الأستان الجيدة نظف جيدة - كولينوس KOLYNOS [إعلان] / تكاليف الجلد الجديد',headline:'[Top-left ad] TANGE lipstick and cosmetics — full-color drawing of a woman applying red lipstick; "Use these colors — lasting radiance for pretty lips" / [Middle-right column] King Farouk I University (Alexandria) — Employment-Office official announcement: hiring for grade-6 administrative positions (male engineers and educators of Egyptian nationality, degree in Business/Public Administration; monthly salary L.E. 8–15…) / [Bottom-left ad] KOLYNOS Dental Cream — cartoon child brushing teeth; "Good teeth need a good cleaning"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0174.jpeg': {arabic:'هل أنت سعيدة؟ / أوقاف السعادة',headline:'"Are You Happy?" — women\'s feature/quiz on happiness; large color portrait of a smiling brunette starlet in an off-shoulder coral-peach chiffon blouse; text summarizes an American scientist\'s list of nine attributes of a happy woman: (1) a wide upper forehead, sign of intelligence; (2) plump, cheerful eyes; (3) full lips indicating warmth; (4) strong constitution; (5) even temperament; (6) balanced disposition — with commentary that Arab women can achieve this happiness if they follow this recipe'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0175.jpeg': {arabic:'كوثر تقدم لك باقة من الفواكه - مياه غازية كوثر [إعلان]',headline:'[Left-column ad] KAWTHER carbonated fruit drinks: "Kawther Presents You a Basket of Fruits" — 5 flavors of the world-famous French-style Kawther beverage: Portakal (orange), lemon, pomegranate, cherry, and Sedar (from lemon squash); available everywhere; drawing of a lineup of Kawther bottles / Main text: continuation of a serialized story with an illustration of a rider on horseback in traditional Egyptian dress (headscarf, jellabiya) speaking to unseen figures'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0176.jpeg': {arabic:'لا يعجبني في أبي - بقلم سعد على أيوب / عسكرى الداورية.. وزير الداخلية / اشترك في اليانصيب الجديد - صابون زفير Zephyr [إعلان] / نحن وأولادنا - عدد الهلال [إعلان]',headline:'"What I Don\'t Like About My Father" — humorous personal essay by Saad Ali Ayoub / "The Constable of the Precinct… Interior Minister" — political-anecdote article about a police officer / [Left-column ad] Subscribe to the New Lottery — Zephyr Soap: prizes up to 100 pounds, first drawing March 31, 1946 — with drawing of a battleship / [Bottom ad] "Us and Our Children" — special issue of Al-Hilal magazine, 6 piasters, 200 pages'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0177.jpeg': {arabic:'يحملان أسرار الوفد / مصلحة المباني الأميرية - تفتيش مباني الدلتا / بكتوريدس Pectoids - قرص مصاصة يهدء السعال - الوكيل الوحيد فؤاد كالو / الأكزيما القرح الطفح الالتهاب - الغازل Zam-Buk [إعلان]',headline:'"They Carry the Wafd Party\'s Secrets" — political photo feature on two Wafd-party officials; portraits and a lengthy analysis of Ahmed Sadeq\'s role in the Wafd\'s negotiations with the British on the eve of independence talks / [Top-left ad] PECTOIDS cough-suppressant lozenges — sole agent Fouad Kalou / [Public notice] Amiri Buildings Authority — Delta buildings inspection: opening electrical-works tender for Ministry of Public Works project no. 2 / [Bottom ad] ZAM-BUK ointment — for eczema, ulcers, rashes, inflammation'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0178.jpeg': {arabic:'جباب بن نتايل صديق موقعه - تلقى الأصفار على قطة كولاتي، دونكلى / إعلان [صور رجل مع كلاب على شرفة]',headline:'"Jabbab bin Natayel and his loyal friend Moqait" — quirky pet-and-owner photo feature: four black-and-white photos of an American businessman (Ricks) on his New York veranda, playing with his beloved Cockapoo dog; text describes how a millionaire businessman refused expensive offers to sell his beloved dog; economic/current-affairs sidebar on the World Bank and the U.S. Wall Street financial crisis of the era'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0179.jpeg': {arabic:'من عند الخضرى! / الفيل الأميركي / أوزة حسناء / هذا هو الخضرى [مقال هزلي عن أدوات مضحكة من الخضراوات]',headline:'"From the Greengrocer\'s!" — humor photo feature: (top-left) "The American Elephant" — small stuffed toy man in a white chef\'s hat with a bow tie; (top-right) "Three carrots and two peas — an elephant made of vegetables!"; (bottom-left) "An amazing centipede made of a single red carrot with a hairpin"; (bottom-right) "A pretty goose" made of an eggplant with a green stem; whimsical anthropomorphic vegetable sculptures crafted by an American grocer'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0180.jpeg': {arabic:'أميركا الصهيونية! - مقال سياسي / تمثال الحرية على رأس الرئيس ترومان [كاريكاتير]',headline:'"Zionist America!" — political editorial/opinion piece criticizing US support for Zionism in Palestine; illustrated with a striking full-column cartoon showing the Statue of Liberty with President Truman\'s face where the crown should be, holding a torch of Star-of-David — captioned "Statue of America… on the head of President Truman!"; discusses Zionist lobbying, US foreign policy in the Middle East, and the future of Palestine'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0181.jpeg': {arabic:'العام الدراسي ينتهي بالضحكات - حفلات نهاية العام الدراسي هي حفلات ناجحة دائماً',headline:'"The School Year Ends with Laughter" — school-life photo feature: (top) three graduating pupils standing in a row in their school uniforms and paper crowns; (bottom-left) a group of teachers dining together at a farewell luncheon; (bottom-right) a professor drawing a caricature at an easel while a nun-headmistress watches; article on end-of-year school celebrations and pupils\' skits'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0182.jpeg': {arabic:'سباق أكروبوليس / صابون إمالة صاهرة إشتراك المصريين لا صعوبة عبد الملك الأمر ولية عبد اليونان / الراحة السريعة والانتظام في الحمى [إعلان دواء]',headline:'"The Acropolis Race" — sports photo feature on the Athens motor rally; retro poster-style illustration of two racers on horseback with checkered flag — race dates listed (Nov 16 and March 20, 1946); note that Egyptian rally driver Abd al-Malik will represent Egypt in Greece / [Bottom ad] Fast relief and reliable comfort from fever pain and headaches — patent medicine (unnamed brand)'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0183.jpeg': {arabic:'البيض طعام وزينة - تلوين البيض / أطباق من البيض / بيض شم النسيم [بيض عيد شم النسيم]',headline:'"Eggs — Food and Decoration — Coloring Eggs" — full-page holiday feature for Sham El-Nessim (the Egyptian Spring Festival): main color drawing of a girl in a rabbit costume sitting in an eggshell surrounded by cartoon chicks; text explains how to dye eggs with natural colors from home ingredients (onion peel, saffron, tea, dyed beetroot); recipes for stuffed and decorated eggs; below, five decorated Easter/Sham El-Nessim eggs illustrated in the bottom border'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0184.jpeg': {arabic:'غرق البنيد.. / إن أغنى رجل في العالم لا يكاد يشتري شفرة حلاقة تفوقها - جيلت GILLETTE [إعلان] / في كل مكان.. خدمة ممتازة - إير فرانس AIR FRANCE [إعلان]',headline:'News column: "The Drowning of the Old Man…" + "Death of the Cannibal!" — quirky bulletin items / [Middle-left ad] GILLETTE Blue Blades: "The richest man in the world can barely buy a razor blade better than this" — cartoon of a hand pointing to the classic Gillette pack; "Sharper, gentler on the skin, Gillette\'s finest" / [Bottom-left ad] AIR FRANCE: "In every place — First-class service" — with drawing of a Constellation-style airliner flying above the clouds; Cairo and Alexandria contact info'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0185.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة قصيرة: خبير النساء! / مصوغات الاسد وجهازات العرايس تعلمت مصوغات الجمال - إعلان / محلات الربوجحسن [إعلان] / منداكو Mendaco [إعلان دواء] / بلمسة الرصاصة - ورنيش أبوعيه [إعلان]',headline:'"Short Story: The Women Expert!" — comic short story about a group of five friends whose escapades take a slapstick turn when a beautiful woman visits their circle; the four bachelors compete for her attention with disastrous results / [Ads] Al-Assad Jewelry & bridal trousseau outfits — Alexandria; Al-Rabou\' Jahassan store; MENDACO cold medicine; Cherry Blossom shoe polish'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0186.jpeg': {arabic:'تجدها في مجلة الكواكب - يصدر عددها الجديد في ٨ سبتمبر [إعلان] / مختارات من الإذاعة: سمع.. هس!',headline:'[Top ad] Al-Kawakib magazine — new issue on 8 September, 100 pages, 5 piasters: "Fascinating topics, thrilling stories, cheerful humor and beautiful photos — you\'ll find them in Al-Kawakib"; large color portrait of a beaming blonde starlet with the tag "Farid Al-Atrash\'s music sheet inside!" / "Radio Highlights: Listen… Hush!" — full radio broadcast schedule for the week (Sunday-Saturday) with times and program names, including Umm Kulthum, Farid Al-Atrash, Mohammed Abdel Wahab songs'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0187.jpeg': {arabic:'هذه السيارة الفخمة هي هدية لقاء «الاثنين والمصور» - سيارة كرايزلر Chrysler [إعلان] / مسبقة! / على الطريقة الأميركية [كاريكاتير] / استطلاع - بقلم الأستاذ محمد خطاب بك',headline:'"This Luxury Car Is the Prize of the Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Musawwar Competition" — full-page ad for a subscription competition prize: a brand-new 1946 Chrysler sedan, worth L.E. 1,200; drawing of the sleek 1946 Chrysler saloon; entry rules for the two-magazine joint drawing — first prize the car, plus other cash prizes / "American Style!" — small cartoon strip / "A Survey" — column by Prof. Mohamed Khattab Bey on national opinion polls'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0188.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة الموسم - عجيب أنك جميلة في «صانعة بسطة» - تأليف الأستاذ فكرى أباظة باشا / بطولة إحسان عبد القدوس - فريد الأطرش - عزيزة عبد - كارمن / إخراج أحمد بدرخان',headline:'"Season\'s Story: \'How Amazing You Are Beautiful\' in the film \'Saan\'at Basta\' (The Simple-Girl Star)" — feature on the big new Egyptian musical film written by Prof. Fikri Abaza Pasha, starring Ihsan Abdel Qadus, Farid Al-Atrash, Aziza Abd and Carmen; directed by Ahmad Badrakhan; six behind-the-scenes photos of the cast — cast reading a script around a table, the director conducting a discussion, a couple embracing on set, and Farid Al-Atrash rehearsing at the piano'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0189.jpeg': {arabic:'أصحاب الجلالة القراء! / هوليود مصر: القاهرة والاسكندرية تهتفان لأفراح / قسمة ونصيب',headline:'"His Majesty the Readers!" — cartoon of a reader as king / "Hollywood of Egypt: Cairo and Alexandria Cheer for Afrah" — celebrity news: the Egyptian film "Afrah" (Weddings) had gala premieres in both cities with actor Farid Al-Atrash and other stars in attendance; group photo of the film\'s cast being cheered by fans / "Fate and Fortune" sidebar — brief note on a Cairo social event with photo of a woman in a mantilla-style head-covering'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0190.jpeg': {arabic:'جريمة الأسبوع: في مصر الكل يسال عن أبو شنب! / تفحص أن أسبرو ASPRO يوفر مفعوله سريعاً ويجلب راحة عجيبة [إعلان] / إعلان',headline:'"Crime of the Week: In Egypt, Everyone Is Asking About \'Abu Shanab\'!" — sensational crime story about a mysterious con-man who impersonated authority figures across Cairo to swindle citizens; illustrated with cartoon of two men whispering / [Bottom-left ad] ASPRO: "Try Aspro — its effect is fast and it brings amazing relief" — with pack shot / [Bottom-right ad] classified notice for a shipping firm\'s tenders'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0191.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة مصرية: الذكرى العائدة - بقلم السيدة صوفي عبد الله',headline:'"Egyptian Story: The Returning Memory" — nostalgic short story by Mrs. Sophie Abdullah; opens with a stylized double portrait of two women (a fair-skinned brunette in profile behind a bronze-skinned redhead in front); story recalls a young woman\'s memories of her earlier trip aboard the train from Alexandria home to Cairo, and the past bittersweet romance she cannot forget'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0192.jpeg': {arabic:'الحبل الأخير من السينما / كاثرين كازلر / اللبنة الحفلة الاعلانية اللبيد فطن / كاترين هبرن / نجوم على قماش الشاشة',headline:'"The Cinema\'s Latest Signing" — celebrity feature/pin-ups: left column has diamond-frame headshots of two blonde starlets (Katherine Kaisler / Kathleen Harburn); right side has a large color pin-up of a blonde beauty (Kathleen Byron/Hepburn?) in a red velvet cape looking upward; text profiles the newest Hollywood contract signings and casting news'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0193.jpeg': {arabic:'ناس.. وحيوانات / رقصة البطن / على المسرح / صيد المصارى / رقصة السرك / في الطريق إلى السيارة',headline:'"People… and Animals" — humor photo essay comparing human gestures to animal movements: (top row) a soaring young woman in a red skirt jumping mid-air captioned "On the way to the car," a rearing horse; (middle) a belly-dancer mid-spin captioned "Belly Dance"; a maid scrubbing a floor; a leaping dolphin — a whimsical juxtaposition of dancers, laborers, animals and everyday people in similar postures; (bottom) marching soldiers vs a herd of sheep'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0194.jpeg': {arabic:'الجريمة الغامضة / كليرصانج CLERSANGES PARIS [إعلان عطر] / هوليود مصر تقدم فيلم مكتب الغرام - إخراج شمس الدين',headline:'"The Mysterious Crime" — serialized crime story, continuation on p.31 / [Right-top ad] CLERSANGES PARIS eau-de-toilette and hair-refresher — with lady in evening gown; sole agents Shita & Co. / [Right-bottom ad] Hollywood Egypt Films presents "Maktab Al-Gharam" (The Love Bureau) — Egyptian musical film starring Hoda Shams al-Din, directed by Shams al-Din — currently in Cairo cinemas'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0195.jpeg': {arabic:'العدد القادم - عدد الصيف - ٩٦ صفحة ٦ قروش / صور بدوي وأطفال متنكرين بأزياء عربية',headline:'"Next Issue Preview: The Summer Issue" — teaser page for the magazine\'s forthcoming summer number, 96 pages for 6 piasters: cover-mockup of a smiling brunette in a blue-and-white sailor blouse behind a car steering wheel; charming photo feature on Egyptian children dressed as "Bedouin family" for a play (small girl as bride, boys as bearded groom and umda/mayor); text lists 60 pages of summer content, humor pieces, and cinema/travel articles from Cairo, Alexandria, Beirut and Damascus'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0196.jpeg': {arabic:'حريتي.. يظهر السارق! [قصة قصيرة]',headline:'"My Freedom… the Thief Appears!" — a short story with a cartoon illustration of a cinema studio scene: a woman in checked cowgirl outfit and pigtails with a masked female bandit at gunpoint, both surrounded by film-set spotlights and a spinning reel; caption: "The actress: \'I\'m going to make you into a bunch of dust!\' — The colleague: \'The director told her to act with realism to make it look natural!\'"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0197.jpeg': {arabic:'الحاس (لبنان) - عش السالمة كذا / جائزتي.. / وتبتسم اللعبة الجدية!',headline:'"Al-Nahhas (Lebanon) — \'Life is Safe So-and-So\'" — political-humor commentary on Prime Minister Al-Nahhas\'s diplomacy; large photo of an outdoor tennis match between two players with a Union-Jack-emblazoned Egyptian player at net; below, reader-response column "My Prize…" and "The Serious Game Smiles!" — mixing sports, politics and readers\' letters critiquing government policy'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0198.jpeg': {arabic:'دورة الجامعة.. كما يرويها على عمو الدين / مصطفى النحاس باشا / رياض الصلح بك / توفيق السويدى بك / الشيخ يوسف ياسين / محمد صلاح الدين بك / الأستاذ حبيب أبو شهلا / أحمد على باشا',headline:'"The Arab League Summit Meeting — as told by Ali Amuddin" — political reportage on the founding Arab League summit; four black-and-white photos of the Arab leaders in session — heads of state in traditional dress and Western suits sitting around the conference table; portraits and quotes from Egyptian PM Mustafa Al-Nahhas, Lebanese PM Riad Al-Solh, Iraqi statesman Tawfiq Al-Suwaidi, Saudi Sheikh Yusuf Yasin, Egyptian FM Muhammad Salah Al-Din, Lebanese diplomat Habib Abu Chahla, and Yemeni delegate Ahmad Ali Pasha'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0199.jpeg': {arabic:'أتكنسون ATKINSONS - ماء كولون [إعلان] / تمنيات لتكسنت لسنة ١٩٤٦ من العددالراسل القاهرة [إعلان مهني] / زواج تحية [قصة]',headline:'[Top-right ad] ATKINSONS Eau de Cologne (British Empire) — full drawing of a chic 1940s couple, the woman in fur cape and the man in a suit, plus product illustration of the bottle; "For every place and every time — a refreshing bottle of Atkinsons cologne with the finest floral fragrance" / "Congratulations for 1946" — official greetings from a Cairo publisher / "Tahia\'s Marriage" — a serialized romance-story installment'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0200.jpeg': {arabic:'قريباً - سميرة موسى في خفايا الدنيا - سيناريو الأستاذ بديع دومى / بيتها الكرسال بالقاهرة [إعلان فيلم] / آخر مبتكرات الشبراويشى - بون سوار Bon Soir [إعلان عطر] / صابون لوريول LORIOL للشباب [إعلان] / كوين اليزابث [إعلان بودرة تجميل]',headline:'[Left-column ad] Coming Soon: Samira Moussa in "Khafaya Al-Donia" (Secrets of the World) — Egyptian film; scenario by Prof. Badie Doumi; large drawing of a groom in tuxedo lighting a cigarette with an inset photo of the bride Samira Moussa in wedding dress / [Right-column ads] Bon Soir eau-de-toilette from Al-Shobrawichi; Loriol shaving soap; Queen Elizabeth complexion powder for a smooth, silky skin'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0201.jpeg': {arabic:'هذه السيارة لك من «الاثنين والمصور» - سيارة كرايزلر Chrysler [إعلان جائزة] / الأستاذ زهير مصرى المالك القدير للمطبعة',headline:'"This Car Is Yours from Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Musawwar!" — competition-prize ad featuring a brand-new 1946 Chrysler Windsor sedan being offered as first prize in the joint magazine drawing; entry rules and total prize value L.E. 1,200 / Feature: "Professor Zoheir Masri, the Master of the Standard Press" — two documentary photos of the printing-press owner working at his typesetting machine and adjusting a large printing-press cylinder'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0202.jpeg': {arabic:'قهر ١٤ من الاثنين ٣ من إبريل - بيينا ستوديو مصر - فيلم فاسدة - محمود ذو الفقار، سامية جمال، حسين فايز، فردوس محمد، عبد الفتاح القصري، ولاد عبد الحميد / إعلان الهلال',headline:'"Egyptian Cinema News — Studio Misr Presents \'Fasedah\' (The Corrupt Woman)" — poster/still ad for a new Egyptian film starring Mahmoud Zulfikar, Samia Gamal, Hussein Fayez, Ferdous Mohammed, Abdel Fattah Al-Qasari, and Awlad Abd al-Hamid — premiering 3 April at the National Studio Misr theatres; full-column dramatic ad with the film cast in still-photograph / [Right side] The Al-Hilal magazine special "summer/spring issue" ad, 200 pages, 6 piasters'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0203.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين والدنيا العدد ٨٤٧ - ٤ سبتمبر ١٩٥٠ - ميزان الحب - في مفترق الطريق [غلاف عدد]',headline:'Full-color magazine cover — Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Donia (Monday & The World) magazine, Issue No. 847, 4 September 1950; theme "The Balance of Love — At a Crossroads": full-page photograph of a smiling brunette in a pink raincoat holding a large tartan-plaid open umbrella overhead against a blue sky; cover price 20m; header masthead in the classic red-and-white magazine logo'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0204.jpeg': {arabic:'كوبيد في دنيا الطيور - كيف يزاول كوبيد الخوارف والفشرة والفلور الأنيق في دنيا الطيور والحيوانات! / خطبة زفاف طائرة',headline:'"Cupid in the Bird World — How Cupid arranges betrothals, engagements, and elegant flirtations in the animal kingdom!" — humorous natural-history illustrated article: six comic vignettes with drawings of courting birds (peacocks displaying feathers, spider-web-weaving spiders, love-doves, penguins in tuxedos, colorful fish, crab-and-lobster couples); each vignette a witty tale of animal mating rituals'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0205.jpeg': {arabic:'نصاب أضحك الأباظة - كاترجيها هؤلاء من قبل! / السيد المجهول [إعلان تنجيمي] / بلسامول [إعلان دواء يوقف الكحة] / السيدة على الكبير جمعية المرأة المدنية ويوم المستشفيات - إعلان',headline:'"A Swindler Who Made the Pashas Laugh" — feature on a legendary Egyptian con-artist who fooled cabinet ministers and pashas with clever schemes; illustrated with cartoon of a Nassab (swindler) getting away with the goods / [Ads] "The Unknown Gentleman" — L.E. 5000 fortune-teller/matchmaking service; BALSAMOL cough syrup — treats influenza, calms coughs; charity notice for Mrs. Ali Al-Kabir\'s civic women\'s association and hospitals day'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0206.jpeg': {arabic:'لا يعجبني في أبي.. - للآنسة لبلى كريمة فريد أبو شادى بك / صورة كاملة الصفحة - الآنسة لبلى فريد أبو شادى',headline:'"What I Don\'t Like About My Father…" — personal essay by Miss Laila (daughter of Farid Abu Shady Bey); large color portrait of Miss Laila Farid Abu Shady, in a red velvet jacket with pearl necklace; the article playfully catalogues her father\'s quirks: his devotion to poetry evenings while she wants outdoor fun, his old-fashioned views on radio programs, his habit of expecting family to attend Qur\'an recitations, etc. — a humorous personal essay from a modern young woman'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0207.jpeg': {arabic:'لأول مرة في الإسكندرية - أحمد سالم - دموع الفرح / مديحة يسرى، حسن فايق، إسماعيل ياسين، عادل ناصر، ثريا فخري، فؤاد شقيق / أفلام فرانتيا Ferrania [إعلان] / امتحان في قصة! / إعلان WORLD SHOE POLISH وورنيش الكرة',headline:'"For the First Time in Alexandria — Ahmad Salem\'s \'Dumu\' al-Farah\' (Tears of Joy)" — film-release announcement for an Egyptian melodrama; three inset headshots of the stars: Madiha Yousry, Hassan Fayek, Ismail Yassin, Adel Nasser, Thoraya Fakhri, Fouad Shafik / [Ads] Ferrania Italian film stock; "World Shoe Polish" — with cartoon of a shining shoe / Front page teaser: "A Story Quiz" contest'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0208.jpeg': {arabic:'البنيه.. محصل العوائد / حكمة سليمان في نصائح الأزواج - بقلم السيد الحديدي',headline:'"The Little Girl… Tax Collector" — humorous domestic story by Ahmad Ubaid: a father recounts the shrewd financial reasoning of his young daughter, who insists on being paid pocket-money for household chores; illustrated with cartoon of a chubby matron scolding a smaller pouting girl / "Solomon\'s Wisdom in Marital Advice" — sidebar of pithy sayings on husband-wife relationships'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0209.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة مصورة: العجلة من الشيطان! / مازدا MAZDA - العلامة المشهورة في عالم الإضاءة [إعلان مصابيح] / واردات حديثاً - المخاديد، الأصواف الفاخرة، مغفرات المائدة، الملابس الجاهزة للأولاد - عبد الحميد مصطفى [إعلان]',headline:'"Photo Story: Haste Is From the Devil!" — 6-panel photo-narrative of a young rich man who rushes his marriage and lives to regret it; photos of a bride at the tram stop, at a jewelry shop, at the wedding, and back at home / [Left-top ad] MAZDA light-bulbs — "The famous brand in the world of illumination" — Thomson-Houston British / [Left-bottom ad] Abdul Hamid Mustafa store — new imports: silk, luxury wools, table linens, ready-to-wear children\'s clothes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0210.jpeg': {arabic:'عندنا جيش من النساء..! / المصانع الحربية / الفرقة الميكانيكية / أعمال المخابرات',headline:'"We Have an Army of Women!" — feature on Egyptian women in wartime military auxiliary services during WWII; large overhead photo of hundreds of women in uniform standing at attention in ranks on a parade ground; sections on the women\'s military factories, the mechanized transport corps, and the intelligence/messenger services; smaller photos of a woman firing a cannon and of women medics performing first-aid on a stretcher'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0211.jpeg': {arabic:'يانصيب الاثنين والمصور - سحب في ١٧ يوليو ١٩٥٠ [إعلان جوائز] / أتكنسون ATKINSONS [إعلان عطر] / ليس بالمستحيل - كرسى بعثى / (البقية على صفحة ٤٩)',headline:'"Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Musawwar Lottery — Drawing on 17 July 1950" — competition-prize ad: top prize a Chrysler Windsor car worth L.E. 1,200, plus cash prizes of L.E. 60, L.E. 50, L.E. 50, and L.E. 50; "Keep three coupons complete — you could be the lucky winner!" / [Middle-left ad] ATKINSONS eau-de-cologne / [Bottom ad] "Ba\'thi" (Mission) chair — supporting government\'s mission chair budget line for public education'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0212.jpeg': {arabic:'الأطفال يحبون هذا القوى - ميلامولت MILLAMALT [إعلان] / الكواكب - توزع مع عددها ٢٥ مارس ١٩٥٠ - كراسة الأغنية الجديدة / امتحان في قصة! / VICKS فايبس / جاءني.. / سبعان تكون كسول لبرود جسمياً',headline:'[Right-top ad] MILLAMALT malt-extract for children — "Children love this strengthening drink!" — with cartoon of a strong smiling boy / [Right-bottom ad] Al-Kawakib magazine — 25 March 1950 issue includes a free "New Song" booklet, 5 piasters / [Left ads] Vicks VapoRub; "Vitabs" vitamins; a body-conditioning tonic / "A Story Quiz" contest answers page from an earlier issue'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0213.jpeg': {arabic:'الأسنان هذه فرشاة تحتوي سرا صحيا - ويزدوم WISDOM [إعلان] / هلاك الحال يتحوى كل شيق وطويل / اركاديا ARCADIA [إعلان] / خمسة تكونين قد أميركية [مقال] / أن تُوقّف الأرض! [إعلان] / A KEY POSITION... WAITS FOR YOU - The Bennett College Ltd. Sheffield England',headline:'[Left ads] WISDOM toothbrushes — "This brush has a healthy secret"; ARCADIA plastic housewares — with cartoon of a hand holding a bowl / [Middle] photo essay on Egyptian and American women teachers/professionals: a woman conducting a class and photo of women in a discussion, celebrating the American-style approach / [Right] English-language ad for The Bennett College Ltd., Sheffield, England — "A KEY POSITION… WAITS FOR YOU. Start training for it NOW!" — correspondence-course careers list (dozens of professions listed for postal training)'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0214.jpeg': {arabic:'عيدك.. من علبة الكبريت! - كيف تعلن الحرارة على الشطئ / أطفال يعرفون قدرهم - الحرية في نوع اللبس / الزوج: التقويم السنوى مش جاب سيرة جوازنا مع أنه قابل كل المصائب بتاعة السنة! / الزوجة: لازم بيدخروا للمصائب الكبيرة!',headline:'"Your Holiday… From a Matchbox!" — humorous DIY column: how to make simple children\'s toys and party favors from empty matchboxes and matchsticks — origami-style creatures and figurines / Cartoon at top: husband (in tarboosh reading almanac) tells wife (in red dress) "The calendar didn\'t include a note about our marriage anniversary even though it lists every misfortune of the year!" — wife retorts "They must be saving room for the bigger misfortunes!"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0215.jpeg': {arabic:'الطريق إلى الكمال! / حكاية سليمان لندقة [قصة] / نبت تركت قابل ]] / السعد سعد المفيد [إعلان بودرة] / حكاية سليمان - بمقلم أنور المصرى',headline:'"The Road to Perfection!" — bodybuilding column featuring reader-champion photos: a young man doing a heavy squat with barbell, and four flexing bodybuilder poses of Egyptian readers; each captioned with name, address and physique measurements / "The Story of Solomon Nadeek" — humorous short story by Anwar Al-Masry, with a comic anecdote from a Cairo café'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0216.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة من الواقع: بكرى.. وشكران - بقلم الأستاذ إسماعيل الجيوك / ظهر - أول فيلم مصرى كامل بالألوان الطبيعية - نعيمة عاكف / نعيمة عاكف وعبد السلام النابلسي وكاميليا وفؤاد شفيق - فيلم بابا عريس',headline:'"A True-Life Story: Bakri… and Shukran" — nostalgic short story by Prof. Ismail Al-Gouk / "Released: The first Egyptian film entirely in natural color!" — feature on "Baba Aris" (Papa the Groom), starring Naima Akef, Abdel Salam Al-Nabulsy, Camelia and Fouad Shafik — the historic first Egyptian color feature film; two photos: (top) Naima Akef in a costume drama scene, and (bottom) a wedding-party scene with Naima, Abdel Salam Al-Nabulsy, Camelia and Fouad Shafik'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0217.jpeg': {arabic:'نصائح ونقود قراء العدد [صفحة عربية] / ILFORD [إعلان أفلام تصوير]',headline:'"Advice and Money to Issue Readers" — full spread of reader letters printed as small columns of tight Arabic text (a page for correspondents); topped by small photos of previous prize-winners; illustration of a family (father, teenage daughter, mother) reading the magazine together / [Bottom ad] ILFORD photographic film (British) — cartoon dog with camera / [Right] shoe-polish and beauty-product ads Cherry Blossom Boot Polish'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0218.jpeg': {arabic:'إخوان صفا.. النثر الفانم / حكمة الأسبوع - رجل الأسبوع - كلام وحصريت / تعرات لا تنمو - حل الزواج / الوليد يعلن / الجزيرة',headline:'"Brothers of Purity… The Ancient Prose" — literary essay column / "Wisdom of the Week" and "Man of the Week" — brief editorial sidebars — cartoon shows an outraged fez-wearing gentleman kicking two smaller men through prison bars / "Marriage Solutions" — advice column with reader letters and short cartoon of a woman / "The Newborn Announces" — birth-announcement mini-column with cartoon'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0219.jpeg': {arabic:'هل تعرف؟ / بعض معاوني رئاسة مجلس الوزراء وقد أنهكوا في فحص التنكيك / صورة الغلاف - نور الهدى / أطيبى شاي الشيخ الشرب [إعلان] / بمناسبة الأعياد - قويدر وطيب [إعلان حلويات]',headline:'"Do You Know?" — political-humor cartoon column: photo of three officials of the Prime Minister\'s cabinet exhausted from processing budget paperwork; below, a photo of another exhausted minister at his desk; commentary on cabinet drama and government financial disputes / [Left column] Cover-shot inset of actress Nour al-Huda / [Bottom-right ads] Sheikh Al-Shirbi tea; Qewaidar wa Toteeb — Cairo confectionery for the holidays'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0220.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين والدنيا - العدد ٨٣٢ - ٢٠ مليماً - ٢٢ مايو ١٩٥٠ - في ربيع مايو [غلاف]',headline:'Full-color magazine cover — Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Donia, Issue No. 832, 20 mm, 22 May 1950; theme "In the Springtime of May": studio portrait photo of a redheaded woman in an ochre yellow long-sleeve dress and gloves, wearing a fabulous wide-brimmed hat decorated with pink roses and cream flowers, red lipstick, against a coral-red backdrop; magazine masthead top right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0221.jpeg': {arabic:'شبان فتوة.. مع «فتوة سابق»! / الحاج إبراهيم أيام فتوة / إشترى ريجينسى - القطبى الكبير / سومى ولنه وفواتير القاهرة - إعلان أفلام مصرية / إعلان WORLD SHOE POLISH',headline:'"Young Toughs (Fitiwwa) with a \'Former Tough\'!" — feature on the disappearing folkloric character of the Egyptian street-tough (fitiwwa); large portrait photo of "Al-Haj Ibrahim in his fitiwwa days" — an old man reminiscing about his brawler youth in Cairo\'s Bulaq district in the 1920s-30s; smaller full-body photo of a young man in period fitiwwa costume with cane / [Right column ads] Regensy watches; the Egyptian film "Sameeh, Wanessa, and the Cairo Bills"; World Shoe Polish black shoe wax'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0222.jpeg': {arabic:'على الرغم من ارتفاع سعر الزيتون في الخارج - لا يزال باعة صابون نابلسي روضة يبيعون بسعر القطعة ٥ملم - المصنوع من زيت الزيتون الخالص - مصانع صابون نقولا كحلا بك المصرية عمرة / سيقولون ما اروع جمالها عندما تستعملين ماكياج فيرى [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad] Nabulsi Rawda soap: "Despite the sharp rise in the international price of olive oil, Nabulsi Rawda Soap is still sold at 5 mils per bar" — made from pure olive oil — Nicola Kahla Bey Egyptian Soap Factories, Cairo; drawing of the traditional square soap bar with stamped seal / [Bottom-left ad] Fire cosmetics: "They will say — how amazing her beauty is! — when you use Fire Makeup"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0223.jpeg': {arabic:'بشاهرون العاب الفروسية - الأميرة فوزية شقيقة صاحب السمو الإمبراطوري رياض ولي عهد إيران / تحية السلام الإمبراطوري / في حديقة المنظرة بحرت الحفلة السنوية لألعاب الفروسية بطهران',headline:'"Watching the Equestrian Games" — royal social feature: two photos of a state visit to Iran and the equestrian games held in the palace gardens at Tehran; Princess Fawzia (sister of the King of Egypt and Empress of Iran, wife of Crown Prince Reza Pahlavi) at the annual royal equestrian games with her sister-in-law Princess Shams; portraits of officers of the Persian Imperial Guard offering the imperial salute to the royals seated in the reviewing box'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0224.jpeg': {arabic:'ما أحلاك يا ريد! - باقة من الزهر يقدمها طائفة الأزجالين بمناسبة حلول الربيع - قصيدة زجلية / أغلى من الدم / ما في في ضميرك؟! / صلاة الزين',headline:'"How Sweet You Are, O Rose!" — a festive spring bouquet-poem in colloquial Egyptian (zajal) verse, offered by the Society of Egyptian Vernacular Poets to mark the arrival of spring; several short zajal poems on love and springtime; illustrated with a color photo of a smiling brunette in a floral turquoise sari-style gown sitting on a divan with a bouquet of white lilies; poem titles include "Dearer Than Blood," "What\'s in Your Conscience?" and "Prayer of Adornment"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0225.jpeg': {arabic:'تعلمت من الانتخابات - للأستاذ على أيوب بك / شاطئ الغرام - بيينا ستوديو مصر - وفريال بالإسكندرية - رخيتاء والبانك ببومباى [إعلان فيلم]',headline:'"What I Learned From the Elections" — political satire essay by Prof. Ali Ayoub Bey on the recent parliamentary election campaign; illustrated with an amusing cartoon of a candidate in polka-dot suit and red frock-coat helping a chubby fez-wearing voter navigate the ballot / [Right side] Full-column film ad: "Shore of Love" — Studio Misr new Egyptian film; showing at Ferial cinema (Alexandria) and Reshita and Paramount cinemas (Bombay); inset photos of the three lead actresses'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0226.jpeg': {arabic:'خاطف الأطفال - غز مستفار سابق [قصة مصورة]',headline:'"The Child-Snatcher — A Former Deep-Cover Story" — dramatic serialized illustrated short story on a red background: two-panel painting of a masked kidnapper in a hooded djellaba brandishing an axe over a terrified villager gasping in horror at the horror-scene; text tells of a rural crime that shocks a village — a story of a kidnapping ring caught by the police, told by a former undercover agent'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0227.jpeg': {arabic:'سكك حديد الحكومة المصرية - صرف تذاكر مشتركة للسفر بين مصر والسودان [إعلان رسمي]',headline:'[Full-page official ad] Egyptian Government Railways: "Joint Travel-Tickets Between Egypt and Sudan Now on Sale" — new interline first-class tickets covering rail, meals, and sleeping-car accommodation between Egypt and Sudan; fare table: Alexandria–Port Sudan or Bilaq £E 19.500, £E 33.500 to Khartoum, £E 30.500 to Juba, £E 45.500 to Kampala; ticket valid 30 days; booking agents include Cook, American Express, Wagons-Lits, and Egyptian State Tourism Company; large photo of a smiling Sudanese porter'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0228.jpeg': {arabic:'كل شيء / كلمة ورد غطاها.. / أرشيف الاثنين - مزاحم البلجيمي، والياس القرومان - محرران فى إصدار الاثنين',headline:'"Everything" — news/reviews digest column: news items on the Wafd party, the Palestine question, Anglo-Egyptian treaty negotiations, and the Arab League session; small cartoon of a fez-wearing man with speech bubble; "Al-Ithnayn Archive" — feature honoring two departed editors of the magazine, Mazham Al-Balqemy and Elias Al-Qoromani, with portraits and brief biographies of their contributions to Egyptian journalism'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0229.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين والدنيا - العدد ٣٢٩ - القاهرة ٣٠ سبتمبر ١٩٤٠ - ٢٧ شعبان ١٣٥٩ - المطربة أسعان [صورة كاملة الصفحة كغلاف]',headline:'Full-page black-and-white portrait — Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Donia magazine, Issue No. 329, Cairo 30 September 1940 / 27 Sha\'ban 1359 — cover portrait of Egyptian singer/actress Asaan (or similar); studio close-up in high-key lighting: dark-haired singer looking up in profile, wearing pearl earrings and a light blue silk gown, with a slight smile; caption at bottom: "The talented singer Asaan portrays the role of Belula in front of her fiancé, singer Farid Al-Atrash, in the film \'Intisar Al-Shabab\' (Victory of Youth)"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0230.jpeg': {arabic:'وحشتنى دى؟! [قصة]',headline:'"Did I Miss You?!" — humorous short story on marital ennui: a bald married man in dressing gown looks in the mirror wistfully, remembering when his wife was pretty and interested in him; the text contrasts his current dull married life with the sparkle of early romance; illustrated with a cartoon caricature of the balding husband and a reflection in a vanity mirror'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0231.jpeg': {arabic:'أول فيلم مصري عن الحشيش - طريق الشوك - بطولة حسين صدقي [إعلان فيلم]',headline:'Full-page film ad: "The Path of Thorns" (Tariq Al-Shawk) — heralded as "The first Egyptian film about hashish" — starring Hussein Sedqi; cast list at bottom, exhibition dates; showing at Studio Roxy, El-Riviera, El-Lubnan, Studio Misr; large photograph of Hussein Sedqi in trench coat holding a revolver with a woman in the foreground; also short story column at top'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0232.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين والدنيا - العدد ٨٢٣ - ٢٠ مارس ١٩٥٠ - ٢٠ مليماً / قد تفوز بهذه السيارة الفخمة [غلاف]',headline:'Full-color magazine cover — Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Donia, Issue No. 823, 20 March 1950, 20m; theme "You could win this luxurious car"; portrait of a smiling brunette in a red-and-white striped blouse and pink beret with green ribbons, holding a tennis racquet ("Lakeside" branded); inset drawing of the prize car bottom right, issue number 26013'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0233.jpeg': {arabic:'مستطيل + مكعب = ؟ / حديث الأمم في عالم الهندسة',headline:'"Rectangle + Cube = ?" — feature on the geometry of new dining and card table designs; small cartoon of a family playing cards around a table; long text on the mathematics of proportion in furniture-making and modern room aesthetics; column at right on "The conversation of nations in the world of engineering"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0234.jpeg': {arabic:'مطبات عن التأمين / آلة تصوير موسكا Moska [إعلان] / د. زبيبيان وشركاه [إعلان] / المال والبنوه / مندكو Mendaco [إعلان دواء] / منتك الربوجحسن [إعلان]',headline:'"Bumps About Insurance" — humor column with cartoon of a doctor examining a mummified patient; "Money and the Sons" — commentary column / [Top-right ad] Moska camera 6×6 by German-Swiss makers, sole agent Dr. Zibibian & Co. / [Bottom-left ad] MENDACO cold medicine; [Bottom-right ad] Al-Ithnayn ad for baby weighing scale / Al-Hilal magazine order line'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0235.jpeg': {arabic:'أنت.. خارج عن القانون! / غدا بسينما مترو ريجينا / الاستعراض الكبير - بنت يا بريز - أجمل بشارع الدنيا - إخراج حلمي رفلة - بطولة محمد فوزي، ليلى فوزي، تحية كاريوكا',headline:'"You Are Above the Law!" — humor column with cartoons of a fez-wearing man dealing with policemen and bureaucrats / [Right-column film ad] Coming Tomorrow at Metro Regina Cinema — The Grand Revue "Bint Ya Bareez" (The Prettiest Girl in the City) — Directed by Helmy Rafla — Starring Mohamed Fawzi, Leila Fawzi, Tahia Karioka; cast headshots inside a heart-shaped frame with stars around it'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0236.jpeg': {arabic:'شيطان السرعة يقتحم! / أتكنسون ATKINSONS - المادلية الذهبية - ماء كولون [إعلان] / أسباع لحام - الوليد الغريم فاصلة اسم',headline:'"The Demon of Speed Strikes!" — feature on the rising number of car accidents and traffic fatalities in Egypt in 1949; statistics on injuries and deaths per year; commentary calls for stricter speed laws / [Middle-left ad] ATKINSONS Golden Medal Eau-de-Cologne — with cartoon of chic couple; "lasting fragrance for every place and time" / [Bottom ads] iron-welding services; other classified notices'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0237.jpeg': {arabic:'صانعة العرائس! / تمثال ياني - النسائية والتمثال الأخير',headline:'"The Bride-Maker!" — feature on sculptor Yani; three photos: the artist "Simone" polishing a large male portrait bust in her studio, and two smaller shots of her elegant female sculptures (a reclining nude and a floral still-life); text describes the sculptor\'s technique in bronze and marble portraiture, exhibited in Cairo galleries in 1948'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0238.jpeg': {arabic:'منطق.. / شقة للإيجار! / تعريفات لاذعة / عندما تبتسم المرأة',headline:'"Logic…" — humor page with three cartoons: a scholar arguing with a fez-wearing man, a butcher demonstrating unusual apartment-hunting logic, and "When a Woman Smiles" (a barmaid with an amused patron) / "Apartment For Rent!" — classifieds humor column / "Biting Definitions" — witty maxims / "Hero of the Week: the husband who resigned as caretaker of his wife!"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0239.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين والدنيا - العدد ٨٢٥ - ٣ إبريل ١٩٥٠ - ٢٠ مليماً - قد تفوز بهذه السيارة الفخمة [غلاف]',headline:'Full-color magazine cover — Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Donia, Issue No. 825, 3 April 1950, 20m; theme "You could win this luxurious car"; art deco color painting of a glamorous auburn-haired woman surrounded by iridescent soap bubbles against a red-orange-blue gradient background; inset drawing of the prize car; issue number 27005'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0240.jpeg': {arabic:'من فضائح المجرم - أعرف كبير.. نفقته! / التنظار يكن ساقه',headline:'"From the Scandals of Criminals — I Know a Big One… His Alimony!" — sensational column on husbands avoiding paying alimony after divorce; illustrated with a cartoon of an escaping man being pursued by an angry ex-wife; commentary on the abuse of Egyptian marital-law loopholes / "Reversed the Score" — sports commentary sidebar'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0241.jpeg': {arabic:'طراز رشيق لقلم الحبر الجاف بيروات Biroette [إعلان] / في جنازة النقراشي باشا / دقة متناهية - تل [إعلان ساعات]',headline:'[Top-left ad] Biroette ballpoint pens: "The Elegant Model for a Dry-Ink Pen" — with drawing of an elegant hand holding the pen; sizes: BIRO MINOR 36 pt, BIROETTE 72 pt, BIROMATIC 165 & 216 pt, BIRO DE LUXE 550 pt / "At Prime Minister Nokrashi Pasha\'s Funeral" — news photo item on the Prime Minister\'s assassination (1948) / [Bottom-left ad] TELL wristwatches — "Precision incomparable — even in a storm!"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0242.jpeg': {arabic:'تمثال يأمر بالصلاة! [قصة/مقال]',headline:'"A Statue That Orders Prayer!" — quirky feature/story about a peasant boy who invented a talking statue that reminded him to pray; illustration of a smiling young woman on a couch holding a small carved figurine; the piece mixes folk-mysticism with humor about religious observance and mocks the phrase "a statue that orders one to pray"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0243.jpeg': {arabic:'جبار الفلاح [صورة كاملة الصفحة - فلاح مصرى في حقل]',headline:'Full-page sepia-tinted photograph — "The Mighty Peasant" — striking rural portrait: two Egyptian peasant men at work drawing water from a well using a shadouf (traditional Egyptian well-lever), palm trees in the background; caption describes the enduring image of the Egyptian fellah at his agricultural labor, hoisting the leather bucket from the well'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0244.jpeg': {arabic:'نتيجة مسابقة المختار (العشرون بعدد سبتمبر ١٩٤٥) / مجلس مديرية بني سويف: الإدارة الهندسية القروية / London Matriculation [إعلان] / مجوهراتك',headline:'"Results of Al-Mukhtar Contest — Twentieth issue (September 1945)" — announcement of prize-winners in the magazine\'s monthly quiz contest; list of names, town, prize amount / Middle: "Beni Suef Directorate Council: Rural Engineering Administration" — official job vacancy notice for engineers (grade 8) / [Bottom-left ad] London Matriculation — British Institute of Commerce and Accountancy correspondence course / [Right column] "Your Jewelry" — reader advice column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0245.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين والدنيا - العدد ٨٢١ - ٦ مارس ١٩٥٠ / أياتي الفتاة المصرية والسودان [غلاف]',headline:'Full-color magazine cover — Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Donia, Issue No. 821, 6 March 1950, 20m; theme "Egyptian and Sudanese girls"; glamour close-up of a redheaded model with milky complexion, smiling in a dark green blouse and elaborate wide-brimmed hat lavishly trimmed with silk flowers, fruits and ribbons in green, burgundy and cream against a warm sunset background; issue number Cairo, Egypt March 6, 1950 / 17 Jumada Al-Awal 1369'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0246.jpeg': {arabic:'دنانير.. باختصار / بينا في مسا/ الأحد ٢ / سينما استوديو مصر / فيلم الموسم دنانير / الأستاذ حبيب - أم كلثوم - عزيزة أمير - الورشة',headline:'"Dananeer… In Brief" — film feature/still page: coverage of the highly anticipated Egyptian musical film "Dananeer" starring Umm Kulthum and Aziza Amir; two black-and-white stills showing (top) a couple in a director\'s office and (bottom) two men in period Abbasid-caliphate costumes (Harun al-Rashid setting); premieres Sunday 2nd at Studio Misr Cinema'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0247.jpeg': {arabic:'التنويم / الجامعة العربية / الانتخابات / إسماعيل الجروف / أسرار الأسبوع',headline:'"Hypnosis" — feature on a stage-hypnosis performance in Cairo with photo of the hypnotist and his subjects; "The Arab League" — political news column; "The Elections" — parliamentary election coverage; two large photos of Islamic religious scholars (Al-Azhar sheikhs in traditional headdress) at a discussion / "Secrets of the Week" — insider political-gossip column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0248.jpeg': {arabic:'خالة «أهرام» أغضبتنى! - ذكريات جامعية بقلم السيدة أميرة السعيد / معركة بين العدد الماضى والقراء - كل إبريل والقراء بخير!',headline:'"\'Ahram Aunt\' Made Me Angry!" — personal memoir by Mrs. Amira Al-Saeed recalling her university days at Cairo University; reflects on a strict female mentor called "Aunt Ahram" from her school years, funny memories of student mischief / Sidebar: "Battle Between Last Issue and the Readers — Every April, the readers are fine!" — reader-letter column responding to the previous April Fools issue'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0249.jpeg': {arabic:'المفاوضات التى تريدها / نجاح وشبس',headline:'"The Negotiations We Want" — political editorial on the Anglo-Egyptian negotiations for Egyptian independence; the article demands that any settlement include Sudan\'s unity with Egypt and complete British evacuation from the Nile Valley; sports photo of racing runners at bottom / "Success and Fizz" — brief sports victory item'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0250.jpeg': {arabic:'ضعت كل منها للآخرى - جيليت GILLETTE شفرات ومكينات وشنطات [إعلان] / كرسي تانساد الكبير [إعلان] / طبيب لبناني ينوم أرنبا',headline:'[Left-column ad] GILLETTE Blue Blades — "Each blade lost to a Gillette-loyal customer" — with slogan and pack shot of Blue Gillette Blades / [Left-bottom ad] TAN-SAD Big executive chair — Standard Stationery Company / [Right-bottom column] "A Lebanese Doctor Hypnotizes a Rabbit" — quirky science news photo of a physician demonstrating animal hypnosis on a rabbit at a Beirut hospital'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0251.jpeg': {arabic:'أنت في حاجة دائمة إليه.. صابون روضة [إعلان] / فيم المنظف السريع المضمون [إعلان] / جاءني..',headline:'[Full-page ad] Rawda soap: "You are in constant need of it" — four oval-frame illustrations of a woman using the soap for personal, household and laundry needs; net weight 100g, 6 piasters; Nikola Kahla-Bey Egyptian Soap Factories / [Bottom-left ad] FYM cleaning powder: "The Fast and Guaranteed Cleaner" — with chess-board pattern packet illustration / "Came to Me…" — reader-letter response column at right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0252.jpeg': {arabic:'الفنون.. جنون! / طرائف من حياة الموسيقيين / ماكس فاكتور هوليوود Max Factor Hollywood [إعلان] / في منتهى الرقة والنضارة! - ٣ ألوان جديدة رائعة',headline:'"The Arts… A Kind of Madness!" — column with sepia sketches and portraits of famous composers (Beethoven, Chopin, Wagner, Rossini, Verdi); anecdotes from the personal lives of the great classical composers, their eccentricities and love affairs / [Left column ad] Max Factor Hollywood cosmetics: "For Your Sake — Three New Lipstick Shades in the height of gentleness and freshness" — with model at a microphone illustration'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0253.jpeg': {arabic:'قضية الصبوات - إبراهيم حبيدة الشاعد الجني - كمال الشناوي - شادية - عبد العزيز محمود / لعبة قلبك (إعلان فيلم)',headline:'"The Case of the Sabawat" — Egyptian film feature: crime drama story about three men accused of a murder in a small village; four large photographs of the three suspects behind bars (Sheikh Ibrahim, and two younger men in traditional dress), plus a scene of the courtroom / [Right side film ad] "The Game of Your Heart" (Lo\'bit Qalbak) — new Egyptian film premiering Monday 27 March, starring Kamal Al-Shinnawy, Shadia, Abdel Aziz Mahmoud'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0254.jpeg': {arabic:'رياضة القدمين / أتكنسون ATKINSONS [إعلان] / بمناسبة الأعياد - فرشيت بابازيان (ساعات) [إعلان] / بيرة ستلا Stella [إعلان]',headline:'"Foot Exercise" — women\'s beauty/fitness page showing eight photos of a woman demonstrating a series of foot-massage and foot-exercise techniques for tired feet, plus five inset detail photos of hand-and-foot positions; text explains modern podiatric care and pedicures / [Ads] Atkinsons golden-medal eau-de-cologne; Frenchic Papazian watches for the holidays; STELLA beer ("the best food for evening gatherings")'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0255.jpeg': {arabic:'أسرار الأسبوع - أنا شخصياً لم أدخل في الانتخابات - شيخ العفر يقول / الغلاء / زعامة عمرو',headline:'"Secrets of the Week" — political-gossip column: (top) news photo of Sheikh Al-Azhar with religious dignitaries at a meeting; feature "I personally will not enter the elections — Sheikh Al-Afr says" — statement from a prominent religious figure declining to run for parliament; (bottom) another feature on the leadership of Amr and the rising cost of living'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0256.jpeg': {arabic:'الدور الذي تخصصت فيه.. ولماذا / حسين رياض / عباس فارس / علي رشدي / منسي فهمي / فؤاد شفيق / عبد الفتاح القصري',headline:'"The Role I Specialized In… and Why" — theater/film feature interviewing six leading Egyptian character actors on the roles they were typecast in: Hussein Reyad (in period soldier\'s costume), Abbas Fares (comic villain), Ali Roushdy (leading man), Mansy Fahmi (comic sidekick), Fuad Shafik (paterfamilias), Fatimat Sedki (housemaid); each with a photograph in their signature role'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0257.jpeg': {arabic:'استطلاع (بقية المذكور على صفحة ٢٠) / سينما ريفولي - كليم البنات / المصور القادم لن يتأخر - عدد الصيف ٩٦ صفحة ٣ قروش / آلة التصوير موسكا Moska [إعلان] / حرج الأمس بارديز',headline:'"Investigation" (continuation of the political article from p. 20) / [Left column ads] Sinama Rivoli — "Kaleem Al-Banat" (The Girls\' Tutor) new film; teaser for next Al-Musawwar summer issue, 96 pages, 3 piasters; MOSKA camera — Dr. Zibibian & Co. (Sole Agent); Alfa radio; Mendaco cold medicine'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0258.jpeg': {arabic:'كنسون الرشاقة بركوب الدراجات / رشيقة السطور والفراغ / رفيقا سعدون',headline:'"Preserving Your Grace by Bicycle-Riding" — women\'s fashion/lifestyle photo spread on the current Cairo craze for young ladies cycling in fashionable outfits; five black-and-white photos of stylish young women posing with their bikes at parks and along the Nile boulevards; captions praise cycling as a way to stay slim and elegant'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0259.jpeg': {arabic:'هذه السيارة هدية - لقراء الاثنين والمصور - في اليانصيب المجاني الكبير - سيارة كرايزلر Chrysler موديل ١٩٤٨ [إعلان جائزة]',headline:'[Full-page prize competition ad] "This Car is a Gift — for readers of Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Musawwar — in the Grand Free Lottery" — full-color prize illustration of a 1948 Chrysler sedan, prize valued at L.E. 1,200; explains the seven-week entry rules with issue coupons; first prize: Chrysler car worth L.E. 1,200; second prize: L.E. 100; ten prizes of L.E. 5 each; fifty prizes of L.E. 1 each'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0260.jpeg': {arabic:'ماذا تفعل.. لو كنت مكان هؤلاء؟ / مجاناً - سر ودجب - نصائح الخالدين للزوج - جيبومين [إعلان] / وزارة المعارف العمومية / حديث العمدة! / أحمد إسماعيل المصري - جبرة الحاياتي [إعلان مصوغات]',headline:'"What Would You Do… If You Were in Their Shoes?" — humor column with cartoons of various awkward situations / "FREE — Secret and Duty — Immortal Advice for the Husband" — free bonus booklet with subscription / [Ads] Jeb-Omen tonic capsules for men from Nile Trading Co.; Ministry of Public Education official job vacancy; "The Village Mayor\'s Talk" column; Ahmed Ismail Al-Masri jewelry shop, King of Silvers'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0261.jpeg': {arabic:'متى تحتفل مصر بالربيع؟ [افتتاحية العدد - إطار زخرفي بحيوانات وطيور الربيع]',headline:'"When Does Egypt Celebrate Spring?" — decorative full-page editorial with an ornate salmon/pink border of ducks, rabbits, chicks, roosters, and other spring animals; text discusses Sham El-Nessim (Egyptian spring festival) and how the whole world celebrates spring with different customs; discusses how Egypt is unique in placing this festival at the arrival of spring; small "Al-Ithnayn" logo bottom-left'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0262.jpeg': {arabic:'احتفظوا بكوبونات نابلسي فاروق [إعلان] / اطلبى شاي الشيخ الشربي [إعلان] / ظهر حديثاً - مع القلي وابنة الحياة - عبد المنعم محمد الأنصاري - مكتبة النهضة المصرية [إعلان كتاب]',headline:'[Top-right ad] Nabulsi Farouk soap coupons — keep collecting for prizes / [Middle-left ad] Sheikh Al-Shirbi tea / [Bottom-left ad] Just Released: "With the Frier and the Daughter of Life" — book by Abdel Moneim Muhammad Al-Ansari — sold at Al-Nahda Al-Masriyya Bookshop, 40 piasters / (Right side) Feature story: photo of a woman opening her boutique and a large piece of machinery (a printing press or industrial equipment)'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0263.jpeg': {arabic:'أنا أكبر كذابة! - للنجمة السينمائية «مني»',headline:'"I Am the Biggest Liar!" — full-page interview/confessional by the Egyptian cinema star "Mona" (Mona Fahmy or similar); big photo of Mona at a chalkboard writing the title in her own handwriting; the piece describes her habit of telling white lies about her age, background, and family in interviews to seem more glamorous, and then feeling guilty; conversational tone'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0264.jpeg': {arabic:'على مسرح السياسة - أهدافنا الوطنية / أفلام الأسبوع [كاريكاتيرات]',headline:'"On the Stage of Politics — Our National Goals" — political editorial by Ibn Al-Balad on Egyptian political priorities: British evacuation, Sudan unity, and Palestine question; illustrated with a Cairo policeman-and-child cartoon at top / "Films of the Week" bottom cartoon strip with three humorous mini-caricatures of political themes disguised as film-review vignettes / "Assassinated the Awqaf Nightlife" — sidebar'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0265.jpeg': {arabic:'اضحك معي / أخافيه / كلام.. وحديث / تعريفات لاذعة / حكمة الأسبوع / موسيقى / هبوط / بطلة الأسبوع / النكتة تأديب وإصلاح',headline:'"Laugh With Me" and "Talk and Conversation" columns — full-page humor collage: "Where can I hide?" advice column, "Speech and Conversation" gossip page, "Biting Definitions," "Wisdom of the Week," "Music," "Landing," "Heroine of the Week," and cartoons: a cook stirring a giant pot; young couple dancing; a driver looking exhausted at the wheel of a car; and a couple\'s marital-humor cartoon at bottom right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0266.jpeg': {arabic:'ابتداء من الاثنين ٦ مارس - سينما ريفولي - كريستوف كولومب - بالألوان الطبيعية - نجم فردريك مارش، توني واندي، فرانك فردي [إعلان فيلم] / الكواكب - توزع مع عدد مارس ١٩٥٠ / كراسة الوجوه الجديدة',headline:'[Right-column film ad] Starting Monday 6 March at Sinama Rivoli — "Christopher Columbus" — In Natural Color — starring Fredric March, Tony Wandy, Frank Verdi / [Bottom-right ad] Al-Kawakib magazine March 1950 issue — includes free "New Faces" booklet, 5 piasters, 100 pages, published Friday 10 March / (Left side) Feature: "Amanah / When you call the phone service…" — humorous account of phone-system frustrations in modern Egypt'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0267.jpeg': {arabic:'افتتحنا خصيصا / سومر تجد عائلة تشتاق جديدة من الأثاث - الشركة التجارية للمبيعات المفوضة [إعلان]',headline:'"We Opened Especially [for You]" — feature/advertorial: photo of a grand ornate polished-wood 1940s vanity dresser with mirror — new imported set from Sumer/European imports; text on marriage preparation and the trend for elaborate wedding-trousseau bedroom furniture; cartoon at bottom of a couple flirting / [Right column] Continuation of a wedding-planning humor column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0268.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين ٣ إبريل - معروضات ومبتكرات الربيع عند شيكوريل - القاهرة، السويس / تريبود بالإسكندرية [إعلان] / فورية النجوم [إعلان بودرة]',headline:'[Left-column ad] SHEKUREL (Cicurel) department store — "Monday 3 April — Spring Displays and Innovations" — new spring dresses at branches in Cairo, Suez, and Tripod branch in Alexandria; large drawing of a fashionable woman in a wide-brim black hat and belted dress / "For the Stars — Nujoom Face Powder" bottom-left ad / (Right side) Cartoon strip "Rich vs Poor women\'s answers to matrimonial ads"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0269.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة الجاسوس / تانك من الاسماعيلية / كلفينيتور Kelvinator موديل ١٩٥٠ [إعلان ثلاجة] / سكك حديد الحكومة المصرية - جداول مواعيد القطارات في فصل الصيف سنة ١٩٥٠ [إعلان رسمي]',headline:'"The Spy\'s Story" — feature/serial from Al-Ismailia (Egyptian city bordering the Suez Canal) about wartime espionage / [Right-column ad] Kelvinator refrigerator model 1950 — "Just Arrived!" — with drawing of the sleek white refrigerator; distributed by the Egyptian Commercial Sales & Engineering Co. / [Right-bottom official notice] Egyptian Government Railways — Summer 1950 timetable schedules just released, sold at all stations for 20 mils'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0270.jpeg': {arabic:'العظماء السبعة.. (تتمة) / علي بك يكن [صورة] / الفرقة المصرية للتمثيل والموسيقى - قطر الندى - بقلم النائب الكبير الأستاذ عباس علام - إخراج عباس علام [إعلان مسرحية]',headline:'"The Seven Great Ones…" (continuation) — biographical feature on Egyptian statesmen; portrait photograph of Ali Bey Yakan (Egyptian delegation member at the 1921 Anglo-Egyptian negotiations); anecdote about Lord Lloyd\'s visits with Egyptian statesmen / [Bottom half-page ad] Egyptian Theater Troupe — "Qatr Al-Nada" — Egyptian musical play in colloquial Arabic — book by great statesman Prof. Abbas Allam, directed by Abbas Allam; cast headshots of male and female actors'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0271.jpeg': {arabic:'نوادر شنكل أفندي [نكات مصورة] / كلام وحديث [عمود صحفي]',headline:'"The Anecdotes of Shankal Effendi" — full-page comic-strip humor column featuring a bumbling middle-aged Egyptian effendi character in various embarrassing predicaments (at the barber, at the tailor, at a restaurant) / Right-column "Kalam wa Hadith" (Talk and Conversation) society-gossip column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0272.jpeg': {arabic:'مضابط المجلسين - كيف يكتبون محاضر الاجتماعات؟',headline:'"Madabet Al-Majlisayn" (Recorders of the Two Councils) — feature on how the official recorders/stenographers of the Egyptian Senate and Chamber of Deputies produce parliamentary minutes; illustrated with photographs of the recorders at their desks and a courtroom-style overview shot of the assembly hall'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0273.jpeg': {arabic:'الوزراء العظماء - سيرة رشدي وعدلي / محمد كامل / مصطفى كامل / سعد زغلول / مصطفى فهمي باشا [صور]',headline:'"The Great Ministers — Biography of Rushdi and Adly" — political history feature on Egyptian prime ministers Rushdi Pasha and Adly Yakan; illustrated with portrait photographs of Mohamed Kamel, Mustafa Kamel, Saad Zaghloul, and Mostafa Fahmy Pasha — the pantheon of early-20th-century Egyptian nationalist statesmen'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0274.jpeg': {arabic:'مصورنا في سينما النصر بالإسكندرية - أطفال الاسكندرية في السينما / احتفال بذكرى سكر [صور]',headline:'"Our Photographer at Cinema El-Nasr in Alexandria" — photo essay: children of Alexandria attending a special screening at El-Nasr cinema, with photos of the children lining up outside and inside the theater; also a photo report on the anniversary celebration of the Sekker family/company'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0275.jpeg': {arabic:'تمام..! ساعات لبيب محمد [إعلان] / بيغ بن Big Ben [كاريكاتير]',headline:'[Full-page ad] "Tamam!" ("Perfect!") — Labib Muhammad watches — cartoon of a man triumphantly holding up his wristwatch / Alongside: Big Ben allegorical cartoon (perhaps a political jab at British parliamentary time-wasting) with the London clock tower personified'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0276.jpeg': {arabic:'شركة مصر للطيران - على أجنحة الشرق [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad] Sharikat Misr lil-Tayaran (Egyptian Airways Co.) — "On the Wings of the East" — illustration of a biplane in flight over Egyptian landscape, with route map notations to Palestine, Syria, Iraq, Sudan and Arabia; slogan promises passenger comfort and Egyptian pride'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0277.jpeg': {arabic:'ميدان الحب [مقال أدبي]',headline:'"Maydan Al-Hobb" (Field of Love) — full-page literary/allegorical article on love\'s battles and betrayals, printed on orange background with decorative Cupid-and-arrows border illustrations; ruminative essay in poetic prose on romantic disappointment and the pursuit of ideal love'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0278.jpeg': {arabic:'تأملات في معركة الانتخابات / كيوي Kiwi ملمع الأحذية [إعلان] / آرت ميتل - الآلة الكاتبة Art Metal [إعلان]',headline:'"Reflections on the Election Battle" — political commentary on the recent parliamentary elections and the shifting political landscape / [Ads] Kiwi shoe polish — illustrated with a kiwi bird holding a boot brush; Art Metal typewriter — office machine ad with a woman typing at a modern desk'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0279.jpeg': {arabic:'صانع الطرابيش - قصة صناعة تراثية / برما Burma ساعات [إعلان]',headline:'"The Tarbouche Maker" — feature/photo essay on the traditional Egyptian craft of making the red felt fez (tarbouche); photograph of an elderly craftsman at his workbench working with the hat mold; text laments the decline of the tarbouche as westernization advances / [Left column ad] Burma watches'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0280.jpeg': {arabic:'مصورنا في بيروت مع الشيخ بشارة الخوري - انطباعات عن رئيس الجمهورية اللبنانية',headline:'"Our Photographer in Beirut - with Sheikh Bishara" — feature/photo essay: Egyptian journalist visits Lebanese President Sheikh Bechara El-Khoury; large photograph of Sheikh Bechara at his mountain retreat plus impressions and interview quotes; commentary on Lebanon\'s political stability compared to Egypt'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0281.jpeg': {arabic:'زميلي الأمير عبد الإله - الأمير الوصي العراقي في مصر',headline:'"My Colleague Prince Abdul Ilah" — feature/photo essay: Prince Abdul Ilah (the Regent of Iraq, uncle of King Faisal II) visits Egypt; three photographs — Prince having tea with Egyptian dignitaries; a young man photographing a tank at a military parade; and diplomatic reception with British ambassador; text reflects on Iraqi-Egyptian ties and the Prince\'s personal charm'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0282.jpeg': {arabic:'المجرمة الغامضة - قصة بوليسية مصورة',headline:'"Al-Mujrima Al-Ghamida" (The Mysterious Female Criminal) — illustrated crime-story serial; large ink-drawing depicting a masked woman in a dark alley with a fallen victim; text describes an escapade of a female jewel-thief evading the Cairo police'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0283.jpeg': {arabic:'المعاصر في حقوق المرأة - ندوة زينب إبراهيم',headline:'"Al-Mu\'aser fi Huqooq Al-Mar\'a" (The Contemporary View on Women\'s Rights) — symposium report on Zeinab Ibrahim\'s women\'s rights forum; photographs of the female speakers and audience; discussion of suffrage, divorce law reform, and workplace equality in Egypt'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0284.jpeg': {arabic:'كلام وحديث / شئ وقدر / نكات وطرائف',headline:'"Kalam wa Hadeeth" (Talk and Conversation) — full-page humor and gossip column with witty definitions, one-liners, and mini-cartoons of Cairo café characters / "Shai wa Qadr" (Fate and Something) philosophical-humor sidebar / Various jokes and anecdotes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0285.jpeg': {arabic:'الأعصام - تقليدات الأفلام [كاريكاتير]',headline:'"Al-A\'sam - Taqleedat Al-Aflam" (Strikes/Sit-ins - Film Imitations) — full-page political cartoon page mocking how contemporary strikes and demonstrations mimic scenes from popular movies; multiple linked cartoon panels showing strikers striking poses copied from famous film heroes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0286.jpeg': {arabic:'الباشوية - كيف استقبلها فكري أباظة بك؟ - فكري باشا.. الطفل [صور]',headline:'"The Pashadom — How Did Fikri Abaza Bey Receive It?" — biographical/political feature on Fikri Abaza Pasha (celebrated Egyptian journalist and orator) being elevated to Pasha rank; four small portrait photos across the top showing him as a baby, as a child, as a young effendi, and as an adult pasha; plus a photograph of him at a café table in animated conversation with a colleague'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0287.jpeg': {arabic:'جهنم للرجال! - في السجن للجدعان / اللحظة المستعصية [إعلان مقهى] / كوكاكولا Coca-Cola [إعلان]',headline:'"Hell for Men!" — feature/story on prison life in Egypt: photograph of two prisoners looking out of a barred window, and photo of the prison yard; text reflects on "prison is for the tough guys" from Egyptian folk sayings / [Right column ad] "Al-Lahza Al-Musta\'siya" cabaret ad with two coquettish woman-with-cocktail-glass illustrations / [Bottom-right ad] Coca-Cola with iconic bottle image'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0288.jpeg': {arabic:'فكاهات الأسبوع / حكمة الأسبوع / هالكس Halex - فرشة الأسنان الجديدة [إعلان] / هنا القاهرة - يا للجرايم [إعلان مسرحية]',headline:'"Jokes of the Week" and "Wisdom of the Week" — full-page humor column with anecdotes about family, marriage, and civil-servant life / [Right-column ads] Halex — the new toothbrush with imported bristles; "Huna Al-Qahira" (This Is Cairo) musical revue at Al-Azbakia Theater'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0289.jpeg': {arabic:'الفار الذي يلعب الكوتشينة - حكاية غريبة / أيهما على حق؟ / الأدب الصيني',headline:'"The Rat that Plays Cards" (Al-Faar Alladhi Yal\'ab Al-Kutshina) — feature with photo of a trained pet rat sitting on a small table with playing cards, plus photo of the male trainer; oddity/human-interest story / "Which One Is Right?" — advice-column dilemma / "Chinese Literature" bottom column and small "Beish Ali Ramad Al-Thameen" pink-bordered poem'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0290.jpeg': {arabic:'الأمير طلال - عرسه على الأميرة نايفة',headline:'"Prince Talal — his marriage to Princess Nayfa" — royal wedding feature: Prince Talal of Jordan (son of King Abdullah I of Jordan) marries Princess Nayfa in a royal ceremony in Egypt; small photo insets show him at the palace tea reception and inspecting a tank at a military display, plus larger photo of the diplomatic party at the wedding reception'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0291.jpeg': {arabic:'طريق الشوك [إعلان فيلم] - حسين صدقي / فتاة الغلاف - مسابقة الاثنين [إعلان مسابقة] / هل تذوقت بيرة مارزن Marzen؟ [إعلان]',headline:'[Top film ad] "Tareeq Al-Shawk" (Path of Thorns) new Egyptian drama film starring Hussein Sidki, with dramatic tri-portrait of the star trio; premiering Monday 15 May at Cinema Al-Kursaal / [Middle ad] "Cover Girl Contest — Al-Ithnayn\'s grand competition — send your photo!" — with big prizes / [Bottom ad] "Have You Tasted Marzen Beer?" — imported German-style beer'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0292.jpeg': {arabic:'كواكبنا في أدوارهن المنزلية - زوزو حمدي الحكيم / نعمات مختار',headline:'"Our Stars in Their Domestic Roles" — celebrity-at-home photo feature on Egyptian film actresses in their private living quarters: Zouzou Hamdi Al-Hakim reclining elegantly on a sofa reading; Nemat Mokhtar posing on the staircase in a maid\'s uniform; and a third actress seated at her piano with a large hookah beside her — meant to show that the stars are ordinary Egyptian women at home'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0293.jpeg': {arabic:'استطلاع - قضية الرجل والمرأة - وجهات نظر النجمات',headline:'"Survey — The Man vs. Woman Question" — feature-round survey: nine Egyptian film actresses respond to questions about marriage, women\'s rights, and the role of women in Egyptian society; three headshots at top and three actresses in emotional close-ups at bottom, with quotes on love, jealousy, and independence'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0294.jpeg': {arabic:'عايدة - تاج الأفلام المصرية [إعلان فيلم] / صدر باعتزاز [عمود صحفي]',headline:'[Full-page film ad] "Aida — Crown of the Egyptian Films" — Verdi\'s opera adapted into Egyptian film starring Suleiman Naguib, Abbas Fares, Ibrahim Hamouda, Abdel Wareth Asr, and Mahmoud Reda; directed by Ahmed Badrakhan; premiering at Studio Misr on 4 January in Cairo and 7 January at Cinema Rio Alexandria / [Right column] Editorial "Bar Sadr Ba\'tazaz" (Chest Filled with Pride) on Egyptian film industry accomplishments'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0295.jpeg': {arabic:'جنجر روجرز Ginger Rogers [صورة غلاف خلفي]',headline:'Back-cover full-page portrait of American movie star Ginger Rogers — Hollywood-style publicity photograph with tight bright curls and vivid lipstick, on sepia-tone paper; caption in Arabic and Latin script; magazine issue #599 dated 3 December 1945, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, published in Cairo/Egypt/Sudan'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0296.jpeg': {arabic:'بلاغيش تر قص البلغم! [إعلان دواء] / حاليا - سينما ديانا بالقاهرة - ساعة لقلبك - كمال الشناوي، شادية [إعلان فيلم]',headline:'[Left half] "Bilaghesh Turq Al-Balgham!" (Bilaghesh Fights Phlegm!) — Bilaghesh cough medicine ad, humor illustration of a wheezing patient / [Right half full-page ad] Now Showing at Cinema Diana Cairo: "Sa\'a li-Qalbak" (An Hour for Your Heart) new Egyptian musical starring Kamal Al-Shinnawy and Shadia, with photo of the couple embracing under an ornate paisley scroll design'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0297.jpeg': {arabic:'معركة حربية يقوم بها الطلبة الأولين! - المدارس الثانوية والفنية والأولية / مسابقة حرة',headline:'"A Military Battle Waged by the First-Year Students!" — feature/photo essay on Egyptian secondary-school students taking part in a mock military exercise organized by the Ministry of Education; large photo shows students in white PE uniforms saluting on a field; smaller photos of wrestling, boxing, and high-jump competitions at the school games day'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0298.jpeg': {arabic:'الغائم [قصة قصيرة] / الشركة المصرية للمريلينا وأدوات المنزل [إعلان]',headline:'"Al-Ghaim" (The Cloudy One) — short-story romance featuring photo of a handsome young couple in evening attire; melodramatic tale of unrequited love and family expectations / [Bottom ad] Egyptian Company for Marilena household appliances and elegant home-decor showroom photo of a modern living-room set with modernist lamps'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0299.jpeg': {arabic:'الزوجة تلقى بحياة اللول للقرود والزوج يصبح بشا.. [صور]',headline:'"The Wife Feeds Her Life to the Monkeys and the Husband Becomes a Pasha" — humorous feature about a colorful Egyptian couple: photo of a woman playing with a small pet monkey/child in a garden; photo of the wife on horseback in the desert; photo of the husband riding an elephant with an African guide; commentary satirizes the leisurely elite lifestyle'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0300.jpeg': {arabic:'الربيع في بلاد الربيع - جزيرة للبيع.. ولكن! / وزارة الشئون البلدية والقروية [إعلان]',headline:'"Spring in the Land of Spring" — travel/feature on Lebanon: photo of a Beirut coastline with mountains, harbor, and palm trees; text describes the spring beauty of Lebanon and how Beirut\'s mountain resorts attract summer tourists / "An Island For Sale… But!" — sidebar about an offer to sell a small Mediterranean island / [Bottom right] Ministry of Municipal and Rural Affairs public notice with cartoon illustration'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0301.jpeg': {arabic:'ساحرة الهرم الأكبر - قصة غرام سياحية',headline:'"The Sorceress of the Great Pyramid" (Sahirat Al-Haram Al-Akbar) — illustrated feature/short story: photo of a female tourist at the pyramids with two Bedouin guides in flowing robes seated beside her; then a photo of a young Western woman with a Bedouin man in the desert; text tells a romantic-mystical tale of a European woman who becomes enchanted by a Bedouin at Giza'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0302.jpeg': {arabic:'بايظ آركية القمصان.. باروكة الأناقة - نبروك كمال [إعلان قمصان] / صاحبة المجلة السينمائية [إعلان مجلة]',headline:'[Left ad] "Baruket Al-Anaqa" (The Wig of Elegance) — Naboroukh Kamal Egyptian shirts and neckties ad, illustrating a stack of shirts, a folded tie, and a woman\'s stockinged legs, with slogan on quality tailoring / [Bottom-left ad] Al-Majalla Al-Sinima\'iyya (The Cinema Magazine) — subscribe today, biggest cinema magazine in the East / [Right column] Political article on the current cabinet'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0303.jpeg': {arabic:'ماذا تفعل عند الخطر؟ [مسابقة كاريكاتير] / فكاهات هذا الأسبوع',headline:'"What Do You Do in Danger?" — full-page cartoon-puzzle competition: a color cartoon shows a startled family confronting a burglar in their kitchen; readers are asked to write in what they would do in each of the depicted danger scenarios; multiple mini-cartoons around the page depict people in various crises / "Jokes of This Week" sidebar'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0304.jpeg': {arabic:'إليكِ.. هذه الكولونيا الجديدة الجذابة - إيرازميك كلاسيك Erasmic Classic [إعلان] / القول كاللحوم',headline:'[Left full-page ad] "For You…" — Erasmic Classic Eau de Cologne — illustration of the tall dark bottle with prices 36, 68, 124 piasters and full-color perfume-shop backdrop; slogan: "Refreshing and Invigorating for All Occasions" / [Right column] "Al-Qawl Ka-l-Luhoom" (Speech Is Like Meats) — philosophical essay column on rhetoric and truth'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0305.jpeg': {arabic:'الفيل المريض كالطفل المدلل [قصة مصورة] / هذا العدد [افتتاحية]',headline:'"The Sick Elephant Is Like a Spoiled Child" — feature-story illustrated with a color cartoon of a screaming wife berating her husband as he speaks on the telephone ("Doctor, come quickly! My wife is going to attack me!"); zoo-medicine humor piece / "This Issue" — editorial column listing the highlights and contributors of the current issue'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0306.jpeg': {arabic:'صور مسرحية - أم كلثوم، عبد الوهاب، أسمهان، فاطمة رشدي، أميرة عزت، يوسف وهبي، سعاد لطفي، بديعة حافظ، حسن الشجاعي، زوزو ماضي، نجمة إبراهيم، دولت أبيض [صور نجوم]',headline:'"Theatrical Portraits" — full double-page photo montage of the great stars of the Egyptian theater and screen: Om Kolthoum (twice), Mohamed Abdel Wahab (Fahd Ahmed), Asmahan, Fatma Rushdi, Amira Ezzat, Youssef Wahbi, Souad Lotfi, Badia Hafez, Hassan Al-Shuja\'i, Zouzou Madi, Naguma Ibrahim, Dawlat Abyad — ~12 circular portrait photographs with editorial commentary by Abbas Mahmoud Al-Aqqad'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0307.jpeg': {arabic:'تهدى محلات سيدناوي - ورقة يانصيب [إعلان مسابقة] / في كل بيت.. أطلبم الصيني وامش [إعلان]',headline:'[Left column ad] Sidnawy department stores gift their customers a lottery ticket — Red Crescent Society lottery with 7000 pounds in prizes, one lottery ticket for every 100-piaster purchase, drawing 1st November 1940 / [Bottom-left ad] SLOAN\'S Liniment for men — pain-relief embrocation with illustration of a man rubbing his aching back / [Right] Continuation of parliament story from previous page'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0308.jpeg': {arabic:'ماذا تفعل لو.. كنت في هذه المواقف؟ [مسابقة كاريكاتير]',headline:'"What Would You Do If… You Were in These Situations?" — full-page comic-strip competition on pale-orange background: four cartoon panels depicting emergency situations — a man about to dive into a fish-filled pond, another lifting a heavy barbell, a third startled by a dynamite crate labeled T.N.T., and a couple in a comic wife-scolds-husband scene; readers write in their answers for a prize'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0309.jpeg': {arabic:'قدت الطائرة إلى السودان - سلام حبشي بك (وزير التجارة والصناعة السابق) [مقابلة]',headline:'"I Piloted the Plane to Sudan" — interview/photo essay with Salam Habashi Bey, former Egyptian Minister of Trade and Industry, who took the controls of an Egyptian Airways plane on a Sudan-bound flight; large photograph of him at the cockpit controls; text discusses his passion for aviation and Egypt-Sudan air links'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0310.jpeg': {arabic:'أطرد التعب الذي يهاجمك بعد الصيف - أسبرو Aspro [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad] "Kick Out the Fatigue That Attacks You After Summer!" — Aspro (Aspirin) pain-relief tablets from Nicholas Ltd. — with drawing of a laughing woman holding up a giant tablet package; prices from 2 to 25 piasters; explains benefits for headaches, muscle aches, cold symptoms and post-summer exhaustion; testimonials at bottom'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0311.jpeg': {arabic:'شركة الأمير للمريلينا [إعلان] / إلفورد Ilford [إعلان] / بريد القراء / نصف حديث الناس [عمود صحفي]',headline:'[Left ad] "Sharikat Al-Amir li-l-Marilena" — Prince Company for household appliances, dish-washing sets and toys; illustration of a woman kneeling with a laundry bag "OMAN BAG" / [Small ads] Ilford film HP3/FP3; "Are You a Master?" contest / [Right] "Nussf Hadith Al-Nas" (Half of People\'s Talk) — Cairo café gossip column with cartoon of two chatty women'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0312.jpeg': {arabic:'في كل بيت.. أطلم الصيني وامشي هي الفضلى [إعلان مسحوق تنظيف] / سلونز - المرهم الذي يقهر الألم [إعلان]',headline:'[Top-left full-page ad] "In Every Home" — Wamashi Chinese-formula cleaning powder — illustrated dish-set and coffee-cups; slogan "She is the Best" / [Bottom-left ad] SLOAN\'S Liniment — "The Ointment That Conquers Pain" — small drawing of the founder\'s bearded portrait / [Right column] Feature story with cartoons of a bureaucratic clerk arguing with a customer at a mail-box'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0313.jpeg': {arabic:'القمر.. تعالى! [قصيدة/محاورة أدبية] / رويال ملعب البنج بونج Royal - عشرات الوصفات لعمل الكعك الطازج في منزلك [إعلان] / حمدي ديال [إعلان أزياء] / تشكيلة عظيمة للصيف',headline:'"Al-Qamar… Ta\'ala!" (Moon… Come!) — full-page literary dialogue in verse form illustrated with a rose-red silhouette of a figure sitting on a crescent moon reading; whimsical philosophical conversation between man and moon / [Right column ads] Royal Baking Powder recipe booklet; Hamdi Dial fashion boutique summer collection; Naseem Aboul-Ela evening wear boutique'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0314.jpeg': {arabic:'الثلاثة الذين أعدموا - قصة الجنود المصريين الذين أعدمهم البريطانيون',headline:'"The Three Who Were Executed" — political article on orange background: on the previous Thursday, three Egyptian soldiers serving in the British Occupation forces were sentenced to death for the alleged killing of a British officer; text argues that the British judicial court did not respect due process; concludes with the illustration of a hand writing (the magazine\'s iconic "Al-Ithnayn" logo) — will the Egyptian people take revenge?'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0315.jpeg': {arabic:'حدث ذات يوم - بين الواجب والعاطفة / أحمد صلاح الدين - مخزن عموم أدوات الكهربائية [إعلان] / فورية النجوم [إعلان بودرة] / حالياً بالقسط - راديو [إعلان]',headline:'"Once Upon a Day — Between Duty and Emotion" — feature/short story on the moral dilemmas of a police officer torn between duty and love / [Right column ads] Ahmed Salah Al-Din General Electrical Goods store; Nujoom face-powder with illustration of a smiling woman by a lantern; "Now on Installments" radio ad with a woman lifting a large record'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0316.jpeg': {arabic:'بريد القلوب / الطرق الجوية البريطانية BOAC [إعلان] / زام بوك Zam-Buk [إعلان مرهم]',headline:'"Bareed Al-Qulub" (Mail of the Hearts) — advice column responding to reader questions about love and marriage in a light-humor tone; small cartoons illustrate the letters / [Ads] BOAC British Overseas Airways Corporation — "Cut Down Your Travel Time to the Six Continents" with clock-face motif and airplane silhouettes; Zam-Buk skin ointment "Famous throughout the world"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0317.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٨٢٣ - نجمة سينمائية بحجاب أبيض [صورة غلاف ملون]',headline:'Front cover full-color portrait of a red-haired female star wearing a translucent white bridal-style veil; deep-blue background; magazine issue no. 823, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 20 March 1950, published in Cairo/Egypt/Sudan; yellow crescent moon logo ("Al-Ithnayn") at top-right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0318.jpeg': {arabic:'شم النسيم.. مع بعثة الفيشة الأهلية [صور احتفال]',headline:'"Sham El-Nessim… with the Nadi Al-Ahli Delegation" — photo essay on the traditional Egyptian spring festival (Sham El-Nessim, Easter Monday): three photos — a woman biting into a salted fish (feseekh); Al-Ahli sporting-club members and their families eating watermelon around a picnic table; kids gathered around a young lady at the delegation picnic'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0319.jpeg': {arabic:'وزراؤنا بريشة طفلة! - كاريكاتير ابنة الوزير',headline:'"Our Ministers by the Brush of a Little Girl!" — feature: an Egyptian minister\'s young daughter draws affectionate caricatures of the current cabinet; large photo of the little girl in an orange-ribbon party dress at left, with five caricatures of ministers alongside (each labeled with the minister\'s name); commentary by the father-minister on his daughter\'s talent'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0320.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٤٤٣ - مارجريت شاجان (كوكب كولومبيا) [صورة غلاف]',headline:'Front cover full-page sepia portrait of Hollywood actress Margaret Chapman (labeled in Arabic "Kawkab Columbia" — Star of Columbia Pictures); reclining glamour pose with feather-touch shoulders; magazine issue no. 443, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 7 December 1942, Cairo/Egypt; price 20 milliemes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0321.jpeg': {arabic:'رهاه.. [قصة قصيرة] / كل الطرق تؤدي إلى روما - ولكن الأفضل على الطرق الجوية البريطانية BOAC [إعلان] / بودرة الملك تمارا [إعلان]',headline:'"Rahaha…" — short story with continuation from previous page / [Right column ad] BOAC British Overseas Airways Corporation — "All roads lead to Rome — but the best is on British Overseas Airways" — with St. Peter\'s Basilica illustration listing destinations Milan, Rome, Nice, Geneva, Zurich, Paris, London, Brussels, Amsterdam, Stockholm, Prague, Budapest, Warsaw, Vienna / [Bottom-left ad] Tamara Talc Powder — with elegant woman illustration'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0322.jpeg': {arabic:'الأستاذة.. - محمد خطاب بك [قصة قصيرة]',headline:'"Al-Ustaza!" (The Female Teacher!) — short story by Prof. Mohamed Khattab Bey; illustrated with a large ink-drawing of an old female teacher standing over a young girl reading from her homework book; text narrates a memoir of the narrator\'s childhood teacher, her strictness and lasting influence on his life'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0323.jpeg': {arabic:'لأي كل عروس خائفة - أمينة السعيد [مقال] / صورة زفاف بأزهار وردية',headline:'"Why Every Bride Is Afraid" — full-page article by Amina Al-Saeed (prominent Egyptian feminist journalist and editor of Hawaa magazine) on the anxieties of Egyptian brides on their wedding day; illustrated with a large full-color photograph of a bride in a white gown holding a spectacular pink-rose bouquet; text discusses the pressures of marriage in modern Egyptian society'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0324.jpeg': {arabic:'لا للحرب! - روح نجوم هوليوود / لاندز راي، غاريس براندا، مارثا هانت [صور نجمات]',headline:'"No to War! — The Spirit of Hollywood Stars" — photo essay on American movie stars\' anti-war stances: portrait photos of Garris Brenda (with feathered hat), Landis Ray, and Martha Hunt; text describes how the stars used their fame to promote peace after WWII; "This Issue" editorial box at bottom'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0325.jpeg': {arabic:'كلبي.. قال لي! - محمد خطاب بك [قصة قصيرة]',headline:'"My Dog… Told Me!" — humorous short story by Prof. Mohamed Khattab Bey; full-page photograph of a man in traditional galabeya holding up a stick as if training his dog while cradling the puppy in his other arm; whimsical text imagines conversations with the family dog on political and social affairs'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0326.jpeg': {arabic:'حل القصة البوليسية / الوفق بين الزوجين [مقال] / محدثات ميلو [إعلان دواء]',headline:'"Solution to the Detective Story" — bottom-right sidebar giving the answer to last week\'s crime-story puzzle / "Al-Wafq bayna al-Zawjayn" (Harmony Between Spouses) — feature/photo of a young Egyptian couple facing each other, on marital advice about compromise / [Bottom-left ad] Mendaco cold and flu medicine'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0327.jpeg': {arabic:'الجواري يرقصن في الحلة - مشهد من مسرحية الخليفة والمهرج [صور مسرحية]',headline:'"The Slave-Girls Dance in the Sultan\'s Palace" — full-page photo spread of scenes from an Egyptian theater production: top-left shows two costumed actors (a soldier holding a scimitar and the caliph on his throne holding a jewel box); top-right shows three actors in comic-drama pose; bottom half is a large photo of a chorus of women dancers in bejeweled harem costumes performing before the caliph\'s throne on stage'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0328.jpeg': {arabic:'دالي.. ما أجملها! [إعلان تجميل] / وجه امرأة جميلة بابتسامة',headline:'"Dally… How Beautiful She Is!" — full-page cosmetics advertisement featuring a giant full-color close-up portrait of a woman with a Mona Lisa smile and dark waved hair; sepia panel with pink stripes on the left describes the product benefits: for eyes, cheeks, skin, and mouth; slogan promises a new radiant beauty'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0329.jpeg': {arabic:'كواكبنا من خلال عدسة التكبير [مسابقة] / قمر ١٤ - سينما ستوديو مصر [إعلان فيلم] / فورية النجوم [إعلان بودرة] / صورة الغلاف - وجه من زهور',headline:'"Our Stars Through a Magnifying Lens" — reader competition: match magnified close-up portraits of stars to their names — prize contest winners announced / [Right ad] "Qamar 14" (Fourteenth Moon) — new Egyptian film Muhammad Zulfiqar / Kamilia / directed by Niazi Mostafa — coming soon to Cinema Studio Misr / [Ad] Nujoom face powder / [Bottom-right] full-color "Cover Image" preview: face-shaped bouquet of red roses'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0330.jpeg': {arabic:'فكرة أريد تنفيذها - عبد الله أباظة بك (وكيل وزارة التجارة والصناعة) [مقال] / تقلص العضلات! - سلونز [إعلان]',headline:'"An Idea I Want to Execute" — political/economic essay by Abdullah Abaza Bey, Undersecretary of the Ministry of Trade and Industry — on a proposal to increase local Egyptian industry investment; photo of him meeting with a group of officials at a conference table / [Right column ad] "Muscle Cramps! - SLOAN\'S — The Ointment That Conquers Pain"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0331.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة تعليمية للأمهات - المؤلف يهاجم البولطي [صور] / ماكلينز Macleans [إعلان معجون] / مياه الكولونيا سبرنج [إعلان]',headline:'"A Cautionary Tale for Mothers" — feature/short story warning about food safety for children with photos of mothers at a market inspecting fish (the Nile tilapia, boulti) / [Right-column ads] Macleans toothpaste with red-headscarved woman illustration "Notice the Difference!"; Sprinj Cologne water "For You The Freshness of Spring"; JUNO branded jewelry showroom / [Left column] editorial continuation on child-nutrition topic'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0332.jpeg': {arabic:'المخفوق أدت إلى الإعدام! - قصة بوليسية بريشة سائق [قصة مصورة]',headline:'"The Whisked Drink Led to Execution!" — full-color double-page illustrated crime story: rendered in muted watercolor and ink; multiple panels — a man in tarbouche threateningly waving a gun at a shopkeeper, then apprehending a robed suspect; melodrama of a poisoning case in a Cairo drink-vendor\'s shop tracked by the police'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0333.jpeg': {arabic:'الشحاذة فن! [قصة قصيرة]',headline:'"Al-Shahaza Fann!" (Begging Is an Art!) — full-page photographed short story about a professional beggar in Cairo; large photograph shows a beggar with three onlookers gathered around him at a doorway; text is a sardonic study of the sophisticated techniques and personas of Cairo\'s street beggars'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0334.jpeg': {arabic:'تعبيرات مصورة - النجمة لعبية نائر [صور]',headline:'"Illustrated Expressions" — full-page photo feature on Egyptian film actress La\'biya Nayer; five photographs demonstrating different facial expressions — smiling, laughing, contemplating, questioning, and pointing — from a coming-of-age acting workshop; on orange-tinted background'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0335.jpeg': {arabic:'الاثنين [صفحة فاصلة داخلية]',headline:'Internal blank/divider page — just the Arabic word "Al-Ithnayn" (the magazine\'s title) in decorative calligraphy on a mostly blank aged page, right-hand column of the page\'s edge visible; used as a section separator inside the magazine'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0336.jpeg': {arabic:'ندوة حريمي - المحرومون من حقوقهم [كاريكاتير] / رقم التليفون الجديد لدار الهلال ٧٩٨١٠',headline:'"Women\'s Symposium" (Nadwa Harimi) — bottom-left political satire cartoon: a fat Egyptian policeman standing over a smaller submissive man kneeling and lighting his boss\'s cigarette; text mocks the deprivation of citizens\' rights vs. the perks of bureaucrats; caption "Al-Sakraan: The key isn\'t hidden anywhere in the house!" / [Bottom notice] New telephone number for Dar Al-Hilal publisher: 79810 (9 lines)'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0337.jpeg': {arabic:'عند ما كان المحامي غلبان قانوني! [مقال] - وليم أسيل',headline:'"When the Lawyer Was Nothing More Than a Poor Legal Advisor!" — memoir/essay by Prof. William Asyl (Wilhelm Ismail) reminiscing about the humble origins of the Egyptian legal profession; illustrated with a nostalgic ink drawing of a lawyer\'s office at \'Souk Al-Attarin\' or similar old bazaar; commentary on how the profession has been transformed by modernization'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0338.jpeg': {arabic:'كنت أنتظر الترام - قصة مصورة',headline:'"I Was Waiting for the Tram" — photo-essay short story: six-panel narrative of a young woman waiting for the streetcar at a Cairo stop, with unwanted attention from various men over the course of an hour; captions describe the harassment as: (1) \'The Elderly Groper\', (2) \'The Pushy Flirt\', (3) \'A Car? … Please Come With Me!\' (4) \'How Rude\', (5) \'This Is Your Mood\', (6) \'And But Sadly Peace\''},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0339.jpeg': {arabic:'تعالى لفكري أباظة باشا / عبد الله أباظة بك [صور] / محمد رياض',headline:'"Come to Fikri Abaza Pasha" — feature/political-satirical column addressed to Fikri Abaza Pasha (leading Egyptian journalist and orator, elder statesman of parliament); portrait photos of Abdullah Abaza Bey (Undersecretary of Trade and Industry) and Fikri Abaza Pasha; text playfully addresses Fikri Abaza with observations about the current political scene'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0340.jpeg': {arabic:'هذه السيارة لك - من الاثنين والمصور - سيارة كرايزلر Chrysler [إعلان مسابقة] / قصة إعلان',headline:'"This Car is for You — from Al-Ithnayn and Al-Musawwar" — full-page prize competition ad: color drawing of a Chrysler sedan; explains the rules of the seven-week entry lottery with issue coupons, with grand prize of one Chrysler car worth L.E. 1,200, a L.E. 100 cash second prize, ten prizes of L.E. 5, fifty prizes of L.E. 1 / "Story of an Advertisement" — right column commentary'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0341.jpeg': {arabic:'امتحان في مصر تصحح أوراقه في إنجلترا [مقال] - نظام التصحيح المركزي في المدارس الثانوية',headline:'"Egyptian Exams Corrected in England!" — feature on the outdated Egyptian secondary-school exam system: government still ships exam papers to England for correction; photograph of a stern examiner marking papers at a large desk; smaller inset photo of a supervisor at an exam room; text argues Egypt should decentralize and use local examiners'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0342.jpeg': {arabic:'ناري كتاب نجريب! [مقال] / فلفل - إسماعيل ياسين [إعلان فيلم] / بلسمول Balsamol [إعلان دواء]',headline:'"My Fire-Book of Tests!" — feature reviewing recent Egyptian humor books / [Right ad] Sinama Rivoli / Sinama Rex Cairo — "Fulful" — new Egyptian comedy starring Ismail Yassin (with photo of star), and co-stars Hussein Fahmy, Rushdi Abdul-Salam, Fahmy Ali; from 10 April at Sinama Rialto Alexandria and Rio Alexandria / [Bottom-left ad] BALSAMOL — cures influenza, quiets popular tremors, stops coughing'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0343.jpeg': {arabic:'فيلم قمر ١٤.. قمر بين الأفلام / نقطة تحول في الفيلم المصري [صور فيلم]',headline:'"Film \'Qamar 14\'… A Moon Among Films / A Turning Point in the Egyptian Film Industry" — full-page cinema feature on Muhammad Zulfiqar\'s new Egyptian musical romance "Qamar 14" (Fourteenth Moon of the Full Moon): color-photo showcasing scenes from the film — the leading couple in a lush studio setting, dance-troupe number, and cast headshots including Kamilia, Rushdi Abaza, Faten Hamama, Hussein Sedqi; commentary praises this film as marking a new maturity for the Egyptian industry'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0344.jpeg': {arabic:'الفنانون والأمراء من شجرة واحدة [صور] - المنسج قدور، رجب حمو، مطلوب أفندي، جيهين مارك، سميحة بيومي، ريتا ماريو',headline:'"The Artists and the Princes Are From One Tree" — feature/double-page photo montage: circular star portraits set on a large orange-brown tree-branch illustration — Jihan Mark, Yousef Wahby, Menassa Fadour, Rajab Hamou, Matlub Effendi, Samiha Bayoumi, Rita Mario, and other Egyptian film and society personalities; article on the intertwined family trees of the Egyptian entertainment aristocracy'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0345.jpeg': {arabic:'جائزة مالية لقراء الكواكب - مسابقة الوجوه الجميلة [إعلان مسابقة] / الأموت أصلح الأعمال [قصة/مقال]',headline:'[Top-right full-color box ad] Al-Kawakib magazine — "Cash Prize for Al-Kawakib readers — \'New Faces\' Contest" — cover with color portrait of a female star, released 10 March; supplement to Al-Kawakib, 100 pages, 5 piasters / "Death Is the Best Business Solution" — dark-humor essay-story on the current cost of living crisis and the recent case of a man who committed suicide to escape debt'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0346.jpeg': {arabic:'الندوة - قصة قصيرة عن الزواج [صورة زوجين على الشاطئ] / الساعات كام؟',headline:'"Al-Nadwa" (The Symposium) — continuation of a short-story serial about a beach-vacation flirtation between a married couple; large color photo of a young couple embracing at the beach, the wife in a red-checkered gingham swimsuit and holding a Coca-Cola bottle; text and continuation of a story on marital dynamics / "What Time Is It?" sidebar contest'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0347.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة واقعية - ولدي الذي أنكرته',headline:'"A True Story — My Son Whom I Denied" — full-page photo-melodrama opener; large photo of a well-dressed young man and woman in a park meadow, the young woman looking down at him lounging on the grass; ornate title in white calligraphy on a black banner announces the story of a mother who was forced to disown her illegitimate son and their reunion decades later'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0348.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٨٣٠ - باربارا ستانويك Barbara Stanwyck [صورة غلاف ملون]',headline:'Front cover full-color portrait of American actress Barbara Stanwyck, in a floral-print blouse with earrings, warmly smiling against a blue-gradient backdrop; yellow crescent-moon Al-Ithnayn logo top-left with the caption "Kawakib Warner" (Warner Bros. Star); magazine issue no. 830, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 8 May 1950, published in Cairo/Egypt/Sudan; price 20 milliemes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0349.jpeg': {arabic:'حتى الاراجوز.. يندد بالديكتاتورية! [مقال سياسي مصور]',headline:'"Even the Aragouz [Puppet]… Denounces Dictatorship!" — feature/political essay: large photo of Egyptian children laughing at a street puppet show, and smaller inset of the two Aragouz puppet-heads on the stage; text explains that a Cairo Aragouz puppeteer\'s show mocking Hitler and Mussolini was one of the boldest public political statements during the war years — Egyptian street humor as resistance'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0350.jpeg': {arabic:'امرأة من نار [إعلان فيلم] - كاميليا مختار عثمان، رشدي أباظة، لولا صادق / ضغطات المدينة',headline:'[Left-column film ad] "Emra\'a min Naar" (Woman Made of Fire) — new Egyptian romantic drama starring Kamilia (Ola in later English publicity), Mokhtar Osman, Rushdi Abaza, Lola Sadeq; from 3 April 1950 at Cinema Rivoli Cairo — dramatic red-and-black poster shows huge scissors bisecting the couple / [Right column] "Daghatat Al-Madina" (Pressures of the City) column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0351.jpeg': {arabic:'جنة الأطفال [صور احتفال أطفال] / تنظيم الاطفال بنفسهم',headline:'"Jannat Al-Atfal" (Children\'s Paradise) — feature/photograph on a Ministry of Education charity event: full-page group photo shows a large mess-hall of orphan children eating a meal at long tables, with matrons ladling soup; text describes the state-run "Dar Al-Aitham al-Faqireen" (Home for Poor Children) and how the organization is helping vulnerable children'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0352.jpeg': {arabic:'كيف تشترك مجاناً في يانصيب شهري مستمر لمدة ٢٠ عاماً - الاقتصاد الشعبي [إعلان مسابقة] / صابون بالموليف Palmolive [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad] "How to Subscribe FREE to a Monthly Lottery That Continues for 20 Years" — Egyptian Popular Economy Corp. investment/lottery bond scheme with an illustrated smiling girl mascot; explains monthly savings-bond system with L.E. 20 or L.E. 40 monthly deposit qualifying for cash prizes / [Bottom-left ad] Palmolive soap: "Use Palmolive Soap for Face and Hands — the soap of the elegant, the soap that lasts long"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0353.jpeg': {arabic:'لذيذة جداً - رد ملاش [إعلان حلوى] / الثروة تنتظرك - يانصيب سباق [إعلان مسابقة] / الأستاذ العاق [قصة مصورة]',headline:'[Top-right ad] "Ladhiedhah Jiddan!" (Very Tasty!) — Red Malash chocolate box, imported from Italy / [Bottom-right ad] "Fortune Awaits You — the New Woman Society Sports Race Lottery — L.E. 5,000 first prize" with drawings of horses and jockeys / [Right column] "Al-Ustaz Al-Aq" (The Undutiful Professor) illustrated short story with a cartoon of a man in the bathtub and a wife scowling at him'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0354.jpeg': {arabic:'المارشال فوزل! - سيرة صالح الفول باشا [مقال] / BOAC الطرق الجوية البريطانية [إعلان] / ستلا بيرة Stella [إعلان]',headline:'"Marshal Fawzel!" (The Chief Marshal!) — political biography feature; large photo of Field Marshal Saleh El-Fawwal Pasha (Chief of the Egyptian Army) in ceremonial uniform / [Right column ads] BOAC British Airways — schedules to Italy, France, England, America with airplane silhouettes / [Bottom-right ad] STELLA beer — "For You Every Comfort and Rest" with lounging man illustration and stella bottle'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0355.jpeg': {arabic:'مشكلات وراء مشكلة الغلاء [مقال سياسي - افتتاحية]',headline:'"Problems Behind the Problem of the High Cost of Living" — full-page political editorial on orange background: analyzes the multiple structural problems (government policies, corruption of ministers, unfairness of tax laws) that lie behind the current inflation crisis; concludes with the iconic "Al-Ithnayn" hand-writing logo'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0356.jpeg': {arabic:'٢ أكتوبر - موعد سحب يانصيب الاثنين - جائزة مالية ١٠٠ جنيه [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad, printed over a stunning collage of Egyptian banknotes and currency] "2 October — Date of the Al-Ithnayn Lottery Draw — L.E. 100 first prize" — the drawing will take place on the appointed date at Dar Al-Hilal opposite the Interior Ministry at 6:00 PM; readers are urged to keep the wrapping envelopes containing the coupons on their next issues; results published in the following issue'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0357.jpeg': {arabic:'المعاهدة - اليد المصرية واليد الإنجليزية [كاريكاتير سياسي ملون]',headline:'"The Treaty" — full-page political cartoon in vibrant color: two hands (one yellow-tanned Egyptian in dress-uniform sleeve, one white British in double-breasted sleeve) rest atop a book (the treaty document), with the Union Jack and the Egyptian flag (green with white crescent and three stars) as backdrop; caption "The Egyptian Hand: I swear by the Almighty that I will preserve this treaty. The British Hand: I swear by the… I will preserve this treaty"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0358.jpeg': {arabic:'عبقريات جديدة [مقال] - بديعة مصابني وسليمان [صور]',headline:'"New Talents" — theater/entertainment feature; two photographs — one of impresario/cabaret queen Badia Masabni with three young admirers in evening dress; the other of Badia embracing two protégées; article introduces the newest generation of talented young dancers and singers being groomed by Badia at her nightclub'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0359.jpeg': {arabic:'الملك فاروق - موهوب / الأخبار.. باختصار [أعمدة صحفية]',headline:'"King Farouk — Gifted" — royal-court gossip feature with a small portrait photo of King Farouk in military uniform; anecdotes about the King\'s musical talents and hobbies / "Al-Akhbar Bi-Ekhtisar" (The News in Brief) column at right: brief items on domestic and Arab-world news of the week including the Doctor Ibrahim Al-Zaher case'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0360.jpeg': {arabic:'السيح الذي يلعب البلياردو - أسطوان بورس [صور مسرحية] / هيكل عظمي يلعب البلياردو',headline:'"The Skeleton That Plays Billiards!" — full-page feature/photograph on the Astonished Doorman theatrical/carnival show at the Astonon Boris cabaret; three photographs of a costumed performer in black bodysuit painted with white skeleton bones (glow-in-the-dark) playing billiards on a darkened stage; the show is described as one of the most novel European magic acts staged in Cairo'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0361.jpeg': {arabic:'الجراج الذي انقلبت جامعة [صور] - مكتبة الأطفال',headline:'"The Garage That Turned into a University" — feature/photograph on a novel American-Egyptian children\'s-library initiative: full-page photo of an orderly library room with schoolboys in white smocks browsing bookcases and pushing library cart; a caretaker helps the children pick books; inset photos of children reading on the floor; text describes how the American Mission converted a garage into a lending library serving Egyptian children'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0362.jpeg': {arabic:'خطاب.. بصمة! [مقال] / إلى الأمهات - صحة طفلك في فصل الصيف - نسلة Nestle نستوجين، لاكتوجين، لبن نستله [إعلان حليب أطفال]',headline:'"Khitab… Wa Basma!" (A Letter… and a Fingerprint!) — column on illiteracy in rural Egypt: charming anecdotal essay about a peasant woman who cannot read her son\'s letter and takes it to the village chief / [Right-column ad] Nestle infant formulas: NESTOGEN (Milk Powder, Half Sweet), LACTOGEN (Milk Powder Fortified), Nestle Milk Concentrate — with baby-in-oversized-hat illustration and 3 stacked can drawings'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0363.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٨٤٧ - مورين أوهارا Maureen O\'Hara [صورة غلاف ملون]',headline:'Front cover full-color portrait of Hollywood actress Maureen O\'Hara (Universal star), red-haired with an elaborate braided updo and white gardenia hair-flowers; magazine issue no. 847, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 4 September 1950, Cairo/Egypt/Sudan; price 20 milliemes; yellow crescent-moon Al-Ithnayn logo top-left'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0364.jpeg': {arabic:'يوميات - أفلام الأسبوع - سينما الكورسال [إعلان فيلم] / بون سوار Bon Soir [إعلان كولونيا] / حفة زوجك [عمود نصائح]',headline:'"Yawmiyaat" (Diary) column — feature/reviews of the week\'s films at Cairo cinemas / [Right column film ad] "Min Faat Qadeemah!" (From the Old Days!) at Sinama Al-Corsal — starring Mimi Shakib, Fouad Zaher; directed by Furid Le Nabi; with cast headshots / [Left column ad] Charrach Bon Soir cologne — with slim seated-lady illustration / "Guard Your Husband" advice column at right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0365.jpeg': {arabic:'أبريل في هوليوود - ديانا لين، آل جولسون، تايرون بور [صور نجوم]',headline:'"April in Hollywood" — full-page Hollywood-gossip feature with three star portraits: Diana Lynn (large color close-up right, laughing red-lipsticked); Ella Raines top-left in polka-dot blouse; Tyrone Power bottom-left in dark portrait; text is a monthly round-up of April news from Hollywood — new marriages, contracts, and films'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0366.jpeg': {arabic:'٣٩ عاماً على باب كلية الحقوق! - أم فرحاي، أقدم فراش في جامعة فؤاد [مقال] / مصوغات جميل [إعلان]',headline:'"39 Years at the Door of the Law College!" — human-interest feature/portrait on Um Farhy (the oldest servant/doorkeeper at the Fouad I University Faculty of Law), photographed in a suit with a distinctive tarbouche gesturing with his hand; text traces his years serving generations of law students and his memories of the students who became famous / [Right ads] Jameel gilded jewelry shop; "Have You Asthma? Faramen Zeuter" ointment ad'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0367.jpeg': {arabic:'المعلم تربية والسيدة فتحية.. في المهرجان الصحي [صور مسرحية] - المدارس تحيي أسبوع الأمومة والطفولة',headline:'"Master Tarbia and Mrs. Fatehia… at the Health Festival" — feature/photo essay on Egyptian schools\' celebration of Mother-and-Child Health Week: three photos from a school theatrical production dramatizing hygiene lessons and family drama for the students; students in makeshift adult-role costumes on stage with parent-audience visible'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0368.jpeg': {arabic:'قلب الأم - قصة مصرية',headline:'"Qalb Al-Umm" (A Mother\'s Heart) — Egyptian short story on a full page with a decorative pink-hearts border across the top; a sentimental tale of a mother\'s sacrifice for her son during the current cost-of-living crisis; final scene involves a robber approaching the mother\'s house at night — heartwarming melodrama'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0369.jpeg': {arabic:'ضحكات المدينة [قصة مصورة]',headline:'"Dahakat Al-Madina" (Laughs of the City) — humor column/story with photo of a bearded Egyptian judge in court robes speaking with a schoolgirl; two elderly turbaned men (traditional sheikhs) sit to the side observing; comic legal-tale of a bilingual little girl outsmarting her rural elders in court; caption "His Excellency listens to the child\'s testimony"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0370.jpeg': {arabic:'نتيجة استفتاء - مسامحة! / بقية القصة.. / ردود القراء',headline:'"Referendum Result — Mercy!" (Msamiha) — reader-poll results: readers voted on whether the wife-character in last week\'s story should have forgiven her husband; box with tally results / "Bakiyat Al-Qissa" (Rest of the Story) — final chapter of the two-part story / "Rudood Al-Qurra" (Reader Replies) column at the bottom'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0371.jpeg': {arabic:'صور الأقطاب التي جمعتها.. الأستاذ كريم ثابت / الملك فيصل / جلالة رضا بهلوي / السيد رشدي / الدكتور بنيش [صور]',headline:'"The Portraits I Collected of the Great Ones" — memoir feature by Prof. Kareem Thabet (private secretary and press adviser to King Farouk); four photographic portraits: (top) King Faisal II; (middle-large) Shah Reza Pahlavi of Iran with a general in full ceremonial dress; (bottom) Rushdi Bey and Dr. Bnaish (Beneš); text recounts his diplomatic-photograph collecting career and his visits to Iran, Iraq, and Czechoslovakia'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0372.jpeg': {arabic:'ضحك الامتحان.. وسبوفيه! [مسابقة] / كويكر أوتس QuakerOats [إعلان] / سلونز الروماتيزم Sloan\'s [إعلان]',headline:'"Laughter of the Exam… and Suboofih!" — reader-competition text/puzzle with photo of the Quaker Oats mascot / [Top-right ad] Quaker Oats: "Give your children the elongated (tall) growth!" — with two happy children and cereal box illustration / [Middle-right ad] Sloans Liniment: "Rheumatism — how to treat it with Sloan\'s" with athletic man illustration; "Abu Chibb, friend of the sixties" slogan'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0373.jpeg': {arabic:'ليلة مع الأرواح والأشباح [مقال] / صور الوسيط وهو في الغيبوبة',headline:'"A Night with Spirits and Ghosts" — feature/photo essay on a Cairo séance/spiritualist gathering: two photographs of the medium (Al-Waseet) in a trance state, wearing a checked shirt and laid back with eyes closed on a chaise longue; article describes the séance procedures, spirit-summoning rituals, and the audience\'s reactions'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0374.jpeg': {arabic:'التاج الحزين.. الذي أصبح أثراً / شفرات جيلت الزرقاء Blue Gillette Blades [إعلان] / الربيع - عدد الاثنين خاص [إعلان]',headline:'"The Sorrowful Crown… That Became a Relic" — historical feature/essay about the exiled Italian royal family and the abdicated crown (following the 1946 Italian republican referendum); tale of the fate of European royal regalia in a democratic age / [Top-right ad] Blue Gillette Razor Blades: "Even Millionaires Cannot Buy Better!" / [Bottom-right ad] Al-Ithnayn magazine\'s special summer issue "Al-Rabee" (Spring) — with big illustrated bouquet-holding starlet'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0375.jpeg': {arabic:'فيلسوف أم مجنون؟ [قصة] / في أثناء نومك أسبرو يخلصك من ذلك البرد! - أسبرو Aspro [إعلان دواء]',headline:'"Philosopher or Madman?" — short-story/feature: melodramatic account of a strange man who claims great insights but everyone thinks he\'s mad — with continuation of a boxing-story serial / [Left column full-page ad] "During Your Sleep — Aspro Frees You From That Cold!" — Aspro (aspirin) tablets ad with reclining woman illustration; "Aspro Ends Colds"; L.E. prices; below IKA vanilla milk-chocolate advertisement'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0376.jpeg': {arabic:'لهنا فقرا.. إلى رحمة الله / وامش الصيني - أطعم الصيني.. تصبح على المائدة روحاً جديداً [إعلان] / مجاناً - نصائح لكل الأزواج',headline:'"To Us the Poor… Into God\'s Mercy" — feature/photo essay on Egyptian charity for orphan children: photo of a young girl in white smock being carried on the shoulder of a schoolboy while classmates cheer / [Right ad] Wamashi Chinese-formula cleaning powder — "Feed the Chinese formula onto your table and give a new spirit" / "FREE — Advice for All Husbands!" — sidebar giveaway of a booklet with subscription'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0377.jpeg': {arabic:'قيتو - راديو هورنيفون Horniphon - الاستيلاء [إعلان راديو] / سيرة الديوي',headline:'[Left ad] Hornyphon radios — "The Latest Model" — full-page illustration of five different receiver models with prices from L.E. 8.5 to L.E. 39; guaranteed models with Egyptian technical service / [Right column] "Sirat Al-Dewi" (Story of the Uncontrolled) — short satirical story about a young man\'s day in court on false accusations, with cartoon of the exchange between the judge and the accused'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0378.jpeg': {arabic:'لغة البلاص [صور] - كواكبنا في البلاص - النجمة تحبيبة توفيق',headline:'"The Language of Water-Jars" (Lughat Al-Balass) — full-page photo feature: female film star Tahiya Tawfeeq poses in various expressive stances holding traditional Egyptian earthenware water jugs (balass) as if in the folk-style dances of Upper Egypt; three inset photos on pink background at right show her holding the jugs against her hip, on her head, and in mock rural-woman poses; the language of the balass is compared to spoken dialect for expressing emotions'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0379.jpeg': {arabic:'أعيني الزوجين [مقال] / روسوس - البدوية Rossos [إعلان بودرة] / وزارة الأشغال العمومية - مصلحة المكاتيا والكهرباء [إعلان رسمي]',headline:'"Ainai Al-Zawjayn" (The Eyes of the Two Spouses) — full-page marital-advice article by Prof. Zaher Sabri: analysis of the different perspectives of husbands and wives on domestic matters, with cartoon of a quarreling couple / [Left ad] ROSSOS Al-Badweya face powder — "The Name Guaranteeing Perfect Quality" — with color drawing of a woman under an ornate scallop-border frame / [Bottom notice] Ministry of Public Works official job vacancy'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0380.jpeg': {arabic:'الأصدقاء الجدد / سنين الأمة [قصة] / احتفن جهاز راديو بهذا السعر - راديو فيليبس Philips [إعلان راديو]',headline:'"The New Friends" and "Sanin Al-Umma" (Years of the Nation) — short story feature on new friendships formed in wartime and its impact on society / [Bottom ad] "Buy Any Radio at This Price" — Philips brand radios starting from L.E. 24.30 with drawing of the receiver; guaranteed for 5 years; installment payments; sold at all authorized dealers'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0381.jpeg': {arabic:'فيزا واحدة.. وثلاثون ألف بر! [صور] - حسن عبد الرحيم في محطة إدريس',headline:'"One Visa… and Thirty Thousand of Blessings!" — travel feature/photograph: journalist Hassan Abdel Rahim in London at Idlewild Airport (Idris Station in Arabic transliteration) being welcomed by an English hostess in polka-dot dress and a top-hat aide; text describes the shock of English visa procedures and the elaborate British protocol for a returning traveler'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0382.jpeg': {arabic:'العفو! - رد ملاش [قصة] / أير فرانس Air France [إعلان طيران] / شركة توزيع المصنوعات المصرية [إعلان]',headline:'"Al-Afou!" (Excuse Me!) — humor sketch with dialogue between an Egyptian gentleman and a European lady on a bus / [Right column ad] The Egyptian Manufactures Distribution Company — Spring sales price-list of imported and Egyptian bank-guaranteed products, with tables of prices for shirts, sheets, and household linens / [Bottom-left ad] AIR FRANCE — with sleek color drawing of a modern airliner in the sky above clouds; "In Every Place, a Superior Service"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0383.jpeg': {arabic:'الأسبوع في رسوم - كاريكاتيرات الأحداث الأسبوعية',headline:'"The Week in Drawings" — full-page political cartoon page divided into four large panels of the week\'s international news: (top-left) two men swimming with a life-preserver labeled \'Yugoslavia\' near Titanic-like sinking ship; (top-right) hand holding up a wine goblet with the map of Africa etched on it; (bottom-left) a hand rising from the sea with sun-rays and \'Egypt\' printed on wave; (bottom-right) an American battleship with the Italian tricolor emblem on its bow'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0384.jpeg': {arabic:'مقال الصباح واليوم [افتتاحية] / أطعم فرانسيا Ferrania - قماش [إعلان] / معجون فرانيا [إعلان معجون أسنان] / TWA أمريكا [إعلان]',headline:'"Article of the Morning and the Day" — editorial column by the magazine\'s editor on current politics / [Right column ads] Ferrania Italian film / "Feed on Ferrania" pasta with color noodles and jar illustration / Ferrania toothpaste — with red tube illustration / TWA Airlines to America — with drawing of an American Airlines airliner in flight'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0385.jpeg': {arabic:'إيطاليا في بلاد جديدة! [مقال] / ملح أندروز Andrew\'s [إعلان] / كيوي Kiwi [إعلان ملمع أحذية]',headline:'"Italy in a New Land!" — feature/political article on Italy\'s post-war reconstruction with photograph of Italian statesmen at a diplomatic reception; text discusses how Italy is emerging from the ruins of fascism / [Right column ad] Andrew\'s Liver Salt with cutout drawing of a man drinking a glass; "Keep Your Health with the Real Beautiful English Health!" / [Bottom-left ad] KIWI Black Shoe Polish with the Kiwi bird mascot'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0386.jpeg': {arabic:'برلين، موسكو، واشنطن، لندن - رحلة عبر مدن الحرب [مقال مصور]',headline:'"Berlin, Moscow, Washington, London" — travel/photo essay on the great capitals of the wartime world with two large photographs: (top) a modern boulevard with double-decker buses and cars; (bottom) sweeping panorama of a war-devastated city center with piles of rubble where buildings once stood; article compares the fates of the Allied and Axis capitals in the aftermath of WWII'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0387.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٨٢٥ - لانا تيرنر Lana Turner [صورة غلاف ملون]',headline:'Front cover full-color portrait of blonde Hollywood actress Lana Turner in a red gown showing decolletage, with sharp lipstick and blue eyes; sepia-blue-gradient background; magazine issue no. 825, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 3 April 1950, published in Cairo/Egypt/Sudan; price 20 milliemes; pink Al-Ithnayn crescent logo top-right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0388.jpeg': {arabic:'طاردت الأنقاض! [قصة] / مجاناً - نصائح للوالدين - كل من عرض على الزواج [إعلان مجاني] / جينومين Jinomin [إعلان دواء] / بامكو - بلمود [إعلان حقائب]',headline:'"Al-Angadh Wa Tardat!" (I Was Followed by Debris!) — comic short story with cartoon of a lawyer being cornered by ruffians in his office / [Right ad] "FREE — Advice for Parents — for everyone who is offered marriage" — free booklet with subscription / [Ad] Genumin nerve tonic capsules for men / [Bottom-right ad] BAMKO BALMUDE briefcases in 8 colors with skin trim, L.E. 2.95, sold in Cairo, Alexandria, and Port Said'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0389.jpeg': {arabic:'مدينة الطلاق في الصيف - رينو - أمير قتان [مقال سفر]',headline:'"The City of Divorce in the Summer" — travel article by Prof. Ameer Qattan: report on the American resort city of Reno, Nevada — famous for quick divorces; large photograph in the middle shows well-dressed men and women at a casino gambling-table with roulette wheel; text describes the divorce laws of Nevada and the summer flock of couples seeking marital dissolution'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0390.jpeg': {arabic:'لا يعجبني في أبي! [مقال] - كريمة اللواء أحمد نشأت باشا - الآنسة زكية',headline:'"What I Don\'t Like About My Father!" — feature/interview: Princess Zakia (daughter of Field Marshal Ahmed Nashat Pasha) frankly discusses what she wishes her father would change; large photograph of her elegantly posed against a black lettered banner spelling out the title; a candid Egyptian teenage-daughter\'s perspective on paternal habits'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0391.jpeg': {arabic:'بريد القلوب [عمود نصائح] / حسن.. الطارة / زوج.. من لبنان / زوجته.. الإسماعيلية / مصوغات الجمل [إعلان]',headline:'"Mail of the Hearts" — advice column: responses to reader questions about marriage, courtship, and family relations, each addressed by pseudonym like Hasna Al-Tara (from the countryside), a Lebanese husband, an Ismailia housewife, etc. / [Right ad] Jamal jewelry: "Wear it with the best of blessings" with woman-in-earrings illustration'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0392.jpeg': {arabic:'المتحف العربي - كاريكاتير سياسي عن حلوان [كاريكاتير سياسي كبير ملون]',headline:'"The Arab Museum" — full-page political cartoon in color: a shrewish woman (labeled \'shariket al-Sharaa\' — the Company of the Streets) piled on a couch with distraught bearded politicians (turbaned sheikhs, tarbouche-wearing effendis) sitting around her being scolded; balloons rise labeled \'Palestine\', \'Wailat Israel\', etc.; caption "The Last Show at the Ice Exhibition… Result?!" — satirizes the Arab League\'s disorganized response to the 1948 war'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0393.jpeg': {arabic:'شهادة دار الهلال - محاسبون قانونيون RUSSELL & CO. [صورة شهادة رسمية]',headline:'Full-page reproduction of an official certificate from Russell & Co. Chartered Accountants (P.O. Box 445, Graham House, Sharia Sulaiman Pasha, Cairo, dated 31 January 1950): certifying the print-run and distribution statistics of Al-Hilal\'s magazines — showing the huge circulation of Al-Ithnayn magazine; red bordering commentary at the bottom explains: "Every year at the start of the year we publish the statement of our circulation numbers to advertisers and readers"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0394.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة الأسبوع - إمبراطورية النساء [قصة خيال علمي] - الأستاذ أحمد جلال',headline:'"Story of the Week — The Empire of Women" — sci-fi short story by Prof. Ahmed Galal (the writer of Bunyan Al-Mareef): a dystopian tale set in the future, where robotic men and human women rule a world in which men have gone extinct; large cartoon-illustration at the bottom shows women elegantly dressed on thrones surveilling ranks of robots; explores the dread of feminism and mechanization'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0395.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة قصيرة - رسم توضيحي لزوجين على أريكة',headline:'Full-page illustrated short-story page — large color drawing of a young couple embracing on a plush red-and-orange tufted sofa: a handsome man in navy blazer leaning toward a red-haired woman in white lace top with elaborate frills, gesturing tenderly to hold hands; text continues from previous page a melodrama of marital reconciliation'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0396.jpeg': {arabic:'كلام.. وحديث / اضحك معي.. / اشرب معي / حكمة الأسبوع [عمود فكاهي]',headline:'"Kalam wa Hadith" (Talk and Conversation) — full-page double-spread humor collage: \'Laugh With Me\' jokes column, \'Drink With Me\' café-gossip column, \'Wisdom of the Week\' column, and cartoons of café characters — a large cartoon of a group of men in fez arguing at a Cairo café; family-humor cartoons; \'Definitions of Ordinariness\' satirical wordplay'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0397.jpeg': {arabic:'مدرسة كوبري الليمون الابتدائية - أولى مدارسها في الشهادة الابتدائية [إعلان] / للبيع - مصعد للبضاعة [إعلان صغير]',headline:'[Full-page ad] Kobri Al-Limun Elementary School (in Damardash Gardens on King Street) — "First among its schools for the Elementary Certificate" — announces the school\'s excellent exam results with photos; classes start 16 September; enrolments open; new campus with all modern facilities / [Bottom-right classified ad] "For Sale — Goods Elevator" — like new, moderate price, can be converted to standard passenger lift; all fittings included; contact via Dar Al-Hilal'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0398.jpeg': {arabic:'بطل على الدغم منه [قصة] - رسم توضيحي لحارس بندقية في حقل ذرة',headline:'"A Hero on the Darkness" (Batl Ala Al-Dhalam Minhu) — full-page short story continuation with large ink-drawing of a young man in prison-striped shirt kneeling in a cornfield holding up a rifle at gun-point; melodrama of a village conflict with wounded honor and revenge'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0399.jpeg': {arabic:'العظماء السبعة.. الذين عرفتهم! - مصطفى كامل، محمد فريد، سعد زغلول، الملك فؤاد الأول، الملك فيصل - بقلم الدكتور محمود عزمي [مقال]',headline:'"The Seven Great Ones… Whom I Knew!" — historical/political memoir by Dr. Mahmoud Azmy — profiles of the seven great Egyptian statesmen he had personally met: (1) King Fuad I; (2) King Faisal; (3) Mustafa Kamel; (4) Muhammad Fareed; (5) Saad Zaghloul, [6 and 7 continued next issue]; portrait photographs of King Fuad I and King Faisal'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0400.jpeg': {arabic:'هل تؤمن بالسحر؟ [مقال] / أمير الدهاء - إعلان فيلم / حالياً بسينما متروبول',headline:'"Do You Believe in Magic?" — full-page feature-essay on Egyptian superstitions with cartoon of a couple at a fortune-teller\'s parlour; text discusses hypnotism, spiritualism, and how educated Egyptians still cling to these beliefs / [Left column ad] "Ameer Al-Daha\'" (Prince of Cunning) — new Egyptian film starring Yusef Wahby, Elsie Weiler, Fatima Rushdi — showing at Sinama Metropol, with prize L.E. 1,500'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0401.jpeg': {arabic:'قصة فارسية - قطرة من العسل - قصة مصورة',headline:'"Persian Story — A Drop of Honey" — full-page illustrated Persian folk-tale: color drawing of an old shopkeeper in Persian robe with red fez trying to persuade a glamorous 1940s Western-styled woman in a red pointed hat and short-sleeved red dress to buy honey; whimsical cartoon accompanies the moral fable about the beekeeper, the sultan, and the drop of honey that caused a war; column at right on cinema-comedy news'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0402.jpeg': {arabic:'أحسن وأغرب صورهم - لمشاهير المصورين [صور نجمات]',headline:'"Their Best and Strangest Portraits — By Famous Photographers" — full double-page collage of avant-garde celebrity portraits: (top-left) a laughing double-portrait of two sisters (Nawal Zayd); (top-middle) sepia legs-only portrait; (top-right) sepia dreamy woman in reverie; (bottom-left) a rag-doll named \'Al-Kalb Al-Ari\' (the Naked Dog); (bottom-middle-right) three haunting portraits including \'Dahayat al-Ghana\' (Victim of Song) and a woman cradling a striped cat'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0403.jpeg': {arabic:'أنت في حاجة دائمة إليه.. صابون روضة Rawda [إعلان] / برما ساعات Burma [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad] Rawda soap: "You Are in Constant Need of It" — with four oval-frame illustrations of daily uses of the soap; net weight 100 grams, 6 piasters; Nikolakis-Bey Al-Kahla Egyptian Soap Factories; "With every 6 pieces get one bar free, 150 grams, 15 milliemes" / [Bottom-left ad] Burma watches, sunglasses, and medical eyewear'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0404.jpeg': {arabic:'بودرة ميرانده Mirande [إعلان] / للسيدات - مفصل فاروق [إعلان محل خياطة] / الكيك سراس في الصحراء [صور فيلم]',headline:'[Left column ad] Mirande face powder — dramatic black-and-white close-up photo of a woman applying the powder from a small mirror-lid box / [Left column ad] For Ladies — Farouk Salon fashion boutique for latest 1945 Cologne and dress styles / [Right column] "The Circus Serious in the Desert" — feature/photo essay on North Africa desert war soldiers entertained by circus performers: photos of soldiers around an accordion-player, plus scenes of desert combat'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0405.jpeg': {arabic:'سحابة صيف.. - الدكتور أحمد زكي بك [مقال] - الأميرة سلطة عبد الرحمن',headline:'"Sahabat Sayf!" (A Summer Cloud!) — feature article by Dr. Ahmed Zaki Bey: photograph of Princess Sulta Abdel Rahman (widow of King Abdullah I of Jordan) at a formal reception being greeted by dignitaries at the Idris Airport in her elegant fur-trimmed black jacket; inset portrait of the Princess; article on how the Prince Nayef of Jordan wedding took the Cairo social scene by storm'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0406.jpeg': {arabic:'جالا أوف لندن - كريم شفاء ليب لاين Leep-Lyne [إعلان كريم]',headline:'[Left column ad] "Gala of London — Leep-Lyne Lip Balm" — new colored lip-heal cream from London imported by Farmacia in Cairo; the ad shows a hand holding a pen writing the words in fanciful calligraphy on the page and rows of pink lipstick tubes; also touts \'Al-Nabl Al-Ward\' (the arrow of the rose) magical lipstick with 10 shades / [Right side] Feature/photo of a village welcoming a visiting dignitary at the village mayor\'s residence'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0407.jpeg': {arabic:'فلسطينية.. تتوج ملكة في بيروت! [مقال] - الآنسة السي، ملكة جمال بيروت',headline:'"A Palestinian… Crowned Queen in Beirut!" — feature: Miss L. (Al-Sa\'i), a Lebanese/Palestinian young lady, was crowned Miss Beirut/Miss Lebanon at a Beirut beauty pageant; the newly-crowned queen elegantly poses in evening gown and thigh-length skirt in a large portrait photograph, with inset photos of her being handed the diadem by the Lebanese Minister of National Education; text tells of the glamorous evening'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0408.jpeg': {arabic:'كل شائق وطريف يجدونه في مجلة الكواكب - سينما ومسرح [إعلان] / حكايات على الماشي [عمود صحفي]',headline:'[Left column full-page ad] Al-Kawakib magazine promotion: "Every enthusiast and enthralling finds it in Al-Kawakib magazine — Cinema and Theater" — with color close-up portrait of a blonde starlet and stars-and-stripes edging; released 10 May; 100 pages; 5 piasters; issue theme: "Al-Hebba Al-Fahera" (The Gorgeous Necklace); starring Robert Taylor / [Right column] "Anecdotes on the Go" — journalist\'s travel-vignettes column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0409.jpeg': {arabic:'أمتن دراجة في مصر - رالي RALEIGH [إعلان دراجة] / مقلوب.. رسمي / حديث العمدة',headline:'[Right column ad] RALEIGH — "The Most Solid Bicycle in Egypt" — with illustration of the black bicycle; "The All-Steel Bicycle — Sold in the Egyptian Market Everywhere" — Sturmey-Archer 3-speed model, product of Nottingham, England — from L.E. 8 / [Right column] "Maqloub… Rasmi" (Officially Overturned) satirical column / [Bottom right] "The Village Mayor\'s Talk" humor column continuation'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0410.jpeg': {arabic:'صاحب معامل زجاج الساعات فايز للسكر - لبيب أفندي محمد / اكتشاف جديد في عالم الأناقة - رفعت وأنور [إعلان] / صحابي كل يوم بمهرة أفكار اهنه [إعلان قرآن]',headline:'[Top-right ad] Personal/business notice: portrait photo of Labib Effendi Muhammad, owner of a watch-repair and watch-crystal factory; announces newly opened service outlet at Suq No. 27, Musky, Cairo / [Right column] Advertisement box for a recently discovered Quran-copy with ornate illuminated Quranic pages (2 photos); "Rafat and Anwar" fashion boutique; and other Islamic devotional items and stationery'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0411.jpeg': {arabic:'هل نغني الحرب / إصابات الحمى بالمصادف - يمكنيها ماكيا حجمك - أسبرو Aspro [إعلان] / خفايا الدنيا [عمود]',headline:'"Do We Sing the War?" — political-critique column: Egyptian intellectuals debate whether to make patriotic-war songs given Egypt\'s status in WWII / [Right column ad] "Sudden Fever Attacks — Beware!" — Aspro (aspirin) tablets ad with anxious-looking male portrait / [Bottom-right] "Khafaya Al-Dunya" (Secrets of the World) — political-espionage column'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0412.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٨٣٦ - بشم النسيم - نجمة بجلابية ملونة تحت كرات ملونة [صورة غلاف ملون]',headline:'Front cover full-color photograph of a smiling brunette woman lying with her chin resting on hands amid a bed of dozens of multicolored balloons (blue, red, yellow, orange, green); yellow ribbon-banner top-right says "Sham Al-Nessim" (Egyptian spring festival); magazine issue no. 836, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 17 April 1950, published in Cairo/Egypt/Sudan; price 20 milliemes; "You could win the small car — enter now" prize contest banner bottom-right'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0413.jpeg': {arabic:'كلام.. وحديث [صفحة فكاهة] / معي الفلوس [كاريكاتير]',headline:'"Talk and Conversation" — full-page humor collage on faded pink background: multiple humor columns with orange-red decorative headers; cartoon of a robber holding up a policeman; large panel cartoon of a battered husband stumbling home in the rain; small orange sun-and-cloud illustration; interior joke definitions and one-liners about marriage, exams, and civil service life'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0414.jpeg': {arabic:'أستاذنا الذي علمناه! [مقال] - بقلم السيدة أمينة السعيد',headline:'"Our Teacher Whom We Educated!" — full-page memoir by Amina Al-Saeed (leading feminist journalist): humorous reminiscence of a schoolteacher\'s foibles; central illustration is a group of turbaned old teachers gathered around a chalkboard and stepladder in a monochrome brown color-scheme; text describes how the students unwittingly educated their eccentric master in modern manners'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0415.jpeg': {arabic:'خاتم الأميد [قصة] - إذا تآمرت الظروف على شخص برى أظهرته بمظاهر الفارق في الذنوب',headline:'"Khatem Al-Umeed" (The Ring of Hope) — short-story feature with humorous cartoons in the margins: illustrated on a coral-pink background with sketches of a police officer, a man with a suitcase, a man in prison, a young effendi behind bars; whimsical tale of a wrongly accused innocent man tracing his misfortunes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0416.jpeg': {arabic:'صنفه دائماً كالجنيه وثمنه لم يزد إلا قرشاً - نابلسي فاروق - صابون [إعلان] / سيارات عطاطة [إعلان]',headline:'[Full-page ad] Nabulsi Farouk soap — features a large detailed illustration of a National Bank of Egypt one-pound banknote crossed by a bar of soap; slogan: "Classified always as the pound — the price only rose by one piaster"; 100% pure olive-oil; 6 piasters per bar / [Bottom ad] Attata Cars — auto dealer'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0417.jpeg': {arabic:'ضحكات هذا الأسبوع - المفاوضات [عمود] / براحة.. برد منش - إنه الطريقة اليمانية للنظام الباطن - أندروس Andrews [إعلان]',headline:'"Laughs of This Week — The Negotiations" — political-satire column on the ongoing Anglo-Egyptian treaty negotiations / [Right full-page ad] Andrew\'s Liver Salt: "With Restfulness — Cold Refreshment — the Yemenite Way for Inner Order" — with photo of a smiling woman drinking a tall glass of the effervescent water; large text and Andrews Salt jar illustrations'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0418.jpeg': {arabic:'ساعتان ونصف في الجنة - بنت باريز [إعلان فيلم] / وزارة المالية / أير فرانس Air France [إعلان]',headline:'[Top ad] "Two and a Half Hours in Paradise — Bint Bariz" (Daughter of Paris) — new Egyptian musical film starring Mimi Sherif, Zubaida, Suleiman Naguib, Farid Al-Attrash; at Sinama Metropol / [Middle ad] Ministry of Finance official notice/tender for stationery / [Bottom-left ad] AIR FRANCE — silver airliner illustration over clouds; "Everywhere, Superior Service"'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0419.jpeg': {arabic:'مباراة في الكذب! [قصة] - إنسان المرأة! / ناقوس العدالة [قصة مصورة]',headline:'"A Competition in Lying!" — full-page short story with a humorous cartoon of two elegant Cairo ladies chatting on a boulevard, wearing modish 1950s dresses (one in white flared skirt, one in dark jacket-and-red-neckerchief); story of two friends who compete in outrageous social boasting / "Naqoos Al-Adala" (The Bell of Justice) — illustrated crime story continuation'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0420.jpeg': {arabic:'بطل على الدغم - بقية القصة / برما - ساعات ومجوهرات ونظارات طبية Burma [إعلان] / بوتر [إعلان دواء]',headline:'"Hero on the Darkness — Continuation of the Story" — final installment of last week\'s story with cartoon in the corner of a group of policemen investigating a crime scene / [Right column ad] BURMA — watches, jewelry, and medical eyewear — from 7 Nadi Fuad First Street, Alexandria / [Bottom-left ad] POTTER\'S catarrh pastilles: "Have You Colds?" — for coughs and throat congestion'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0421.jpeg': {arabic:'اضاء الطروب.. وجه جديد / الراديو اليوم لا يوض بأربعة صالح النسيم [إعلان راديو] / لم تصر وتصعدي وحن ابرك ذر؟ [إعلان طعام] / حالياً أوكازيون عماد الدين - تصفية بلا رفيقة [إعلان]',headline:'"Adayat Al-Tarob" (Illuminations of the Elegant) — new-face column: reader-submitted photos of glamorous social debutantes / [Right column ads] Al-Radio Al-Yowm modern receivers, Sadeq Al-Naseem Frigidaire; food-storage refrigerator with drawing of woman shopping; a men\'s suit sale; and "Now Now Emad Al-Din — Blowout Clearance Without Friends" ad with megaphone-shouting mascot'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0422.jpeg': {arabic:'هوليوود مصر - أول مرة على مسرح كازينو وبرا [عمود] / سينما راديو - الزوجة السابعة [إعلان فيلم]',headline:'[Left column film ad] "Sinama Radio: Al-Zawja Al-Sabi\'a" (The Seventh Wife) — new Egyptian comedy film starring Mary Kwini, Muhammad Fawzy, Suleiman Naguib, Shadia; directed by Ibrahim Emara; distributed by Aflam Misr, at Sinama Misr and Sinama Rex / [Right column] "Hoolywood Misr" (Egyptian Hollywood) column: preview of the summer\'s first "opera on stage" at Casino Opera with the star-cast unveiled'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0423.jpeg': {arabic:'١٠٠٠ طلقة نار في زفاف وزير المالية! [صور احتفال] - زفاف الدكتور زكي عبد المتعال / كعكة الأعراس - سلاح رجال الصعيد',headline:'"1,000 Gunshots at the Wedding of the Minister of Finance!" — feature/photo essay: (top) large photo of the al-Sudan-al-Ithnayn wedding party with the maulids musicians and dancers on the terrace under the pergola with a full band; (bottom) close-up photo of the bride and groom cutting the giant wedding cake; groom is Dr. Zaki Abdel Muta\'al (Minister of Finance); text describes the traditional Upper Egyptian celebration with rifle-fire'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0424.jpeg': {arabic:'بقية القصة - رسم توضيحي لخيال / نساء زوج',headline:'Full-page short-story continuation illustrated with a corner ink-drawing of a horseback rider in the mist under a dark cloud; narrative continuation of a marital-strife story that began several pages earlier; text weaves between the perspectives of a husband and wife caught in a domestic misunderstanding, with fragmented italicized dialogue passages'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0425.jpeg': {arabic:'العربية [كاريكاتير سياسي كبير ملون] - السويدي باشا: تفكروا إنه راح بغدر بستني [العرب في البحر]',headline:'"Al-Arabiyya" (The Arab League) — full-page color political cartoon: a group of Arab statesmen (in fez, turban, keffiyeh) stand on a dry patch as a red sea labeled \'Al-Arabiyya\' floods around them, with one drowning in the water; caption from El-Suwaidy Pasha of Iraq: "They think he went ahead to promise Palestine…" — satirizes Arab League disunity in the aftermath of the 1948 Nakba'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0426.jpeg': {arabic:'ماذا للشعب؟ - الدكتور حسين مؤنس [مقال سياسي]',headline:'"What for the People?" — political essay by Dr. Hussein Mo\'nis: full-page article criticizing the government\'s spending priorities; illustrated with a scene of Cairo (drawing of turbaned man with rifle in a palm-tree village); argues government should invest in public services (water, hospitals, schools) not palaces and grand boulevards; asks why nothing is done despite abundant tax revenues'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0427.jpeg': {arabic:'صور الأقطاب.. (بقية) / السيد رشدي، الملك حسين، الدكتور بشرزيلي، الأميرة نيلي ماري / رشدي آراس / لور برذرز LEVER BROTHERS - سنلايت [إعلان]',headline:'"Portraits of the Great Ones" (continuation) — political-memoir portraits: (top-right) young King Hussein of Jordan photograph; commentary on Egyptian, Jordanian, Iraqi statesmen; SS Frontier ambassadors; Princess Neli Marie / [Ads] Lever Brothers Port Said soap works; Sunlight soap; and Rushdi Aras (Turkish Foreign Minister) portrait and article'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0428.jpeg': {arabic:'هوليوود مصر - حسين صدقي يحارب المخدرات! [مقال] / أختي ستينة [إعلان فيلم]',headline:'"Hollywood Misr — Hussein Sidki Fights Drugs!" — cinema-industry feature on Egyptian film star Hussein Sidki\'s new anti-drug propaganda film \'Tareek Al-Sulook\' (The Path of Behavior); portrait photo of Sidki in police uniform; large behind-the-scenes photograph at bottom of the shooting of \'Ukhti Setina\' (My Sister Setina) at Sinama Nahas with Sabah Hussein Fawzy, Wasfi Abdel Wahab; smaller stills of the film\'s key scenes'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0429.jpeg': {arabic:'حكمة الطويقة! - رعية الأسطورة - الأستاذ حبيب جاماتي [مقال]',headline:'"Hikmet Al-Tariqa!" (Wisdom of the Way!) — full-page article by Prof. Habib Jamati recounting a Chinese/Japanese folk legend: large color drawing at top illustrates the story — a Japanese prince in traditional dress sitting under a cherry blossom tree conversing with an elegantly kimono-clad Japanese princess who holds a red-and-gold decorated lantern; text is an allegory on marriage, jealousy, and the folly of hasty judgments'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 2/ethnayn2_0430.jpeg': {arabic:'غلاف العدد ٨٢٧ - وجه امرأة من الأزهار والأوراق [صورة غلاف فنية ملونة]',headline:'Front cover full-color surrealist illustration: a stylized ivory-toned female face composed of a collage of flowers, leaves, and greenery — the eyes are green leaves, the mouth ruby-red, and the coiffure and shoulders formed of layered blossoms and greenery; magazine issue no. 827, Al-Ithnayn wa Al-Dunya, dated 17 April 1950 (Sham Al-Nessim spring-festival issue); price 20 milliemes; yellow diamond bottom-right shows the car-lottery prize illustration'},
  'Al-ethnayn wa aldonya 3/ethnayn3_0001.jpeg': {arabic:'أم كلثوم في حفلة افتتاح سينما الشرق بالسيّدة زينب',headline:'Um Kulthum at the Opening of Cinema El-Shark in Sayyida Zeinab'},
